{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017GTfdZHWgJZMC4gxNjWBdh","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'C1 保留但降低 claim 强度：ContamCal provides statistically grounded calibration\n2\t  with UQ, outperforming naive/mitigation-based approaches on point estimates, but\n3\t  advantage over linear regression and single-signal 2PL is marginal (overlapping\n4\t  95% bootstrap CIs). UQ 是独特贡献——其他 baselines 无 credible intervals，coverage ~0.85 虽未达\n5\t  nominal 0.95 但远优于 bootstrap CI (~0.72)。C2 完全降级为 method-specific signal failure modes：\n6\t  S2/S4 在 1.5B/3B 仍无效（AUC<0.60），''scale-dependent'' 不可验证；Min-K++ 方向性反转 在所有 scale 持续存在（Cohen''s\n7\t  d -1.0 to -2.7），这是核心 empirical finding。RRF fusion 在所有 scale 退化为 S1-dominated mode（RRF-4\n8\t  AUC ≈ S1 AUC - 0.01-0.02）， 讨论移入 Limitations 但保留 meta-circularity argument。C3 identifiability\n9\t  threshold 上调至 AUC≥0.80：simulation 在 AUC=0.55 仍可 recover γ（bias<0.02），但 real data\n10\t  的 local independence violation + heterogeneous contamination effects 使得实际 threshold\n11\t  更高。关键补充讨论：(1) 0.5B contamination regression——SFT 注入污染数据导致小模型能力 退化 7-15pp，IRT 无法修复因为\n12\t  θ degradation 不可逆；(2) 3B GSM8K format confound—— d000→d100 的 58pp 跳升主要是 SFT 教会模型\n13\t  GSM8K 答题格式而非纯 contamination memorization；(3) Coverage gap (0.85 vs 0.95 nominal)\n14\t  归因于 local independence violation + single-γ per benchmark 无法捕获 scale-specific effects。\n15\t\n16\t  '\n17\timagined_experiments:\n18\t- name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n19\t  plan_id: exp-002\n20\t  description: '在 exp-001 产出的全部 contaminated + clean 模型上计算 4 个 detection signals。\n21\t    0.5B 数据已有（exp_002_signals_05B），此处扩展至 1.5B 和 3B。关键问题：S2/S4 在更大 scale 是否恢复有效性。\n22\t\n23\t    '\n24\t  expected_results:\n25\t    S1_d005_15B_mmlu_auc: 0.961\n26\t    S1_d005_15B_gsm8k_auc: 0.978\n27\t    S1_d005_15B_arc_auc: 0.99\n28\t    S2_d005_15B_mmlu_auc: 0.502\n29\t    S2_d005_15B_gsm8k_auc: 0.489\n30\t    S2_d005_15B_arc_auc: 0.515\n31\t    S3_d005_15B_mmlu_auc: 0.535\n32\t    S3_d005_15B_gsm8k_auc: 0.52\n33\t    S3_d005_15B_arc_auc: 0.548\n34\t    S4_d005_15B_mmlu_auc: 0.523\n35\t    S4_d005_15B_gsm8k_auc: 0.508\n36\t    S4_d005_15B_arc_auc: 0.537\n37\t    S1_d005_3B_mmlu_auc: 0.955\n38\t    S1_d005_3B_gsm8k_auc: 0.972\n39\t    S1_d005_3B_arc_auc: 0.986\n40\t    S2_d005_3B_mmlu_auc: 0.538\n41\t    S2_d005_3B_gsm8k_auc: 0.512\n42\t    S2_d005_3B_arc_auc: 0.552\n43\t    S3_d005_3B_mmlu_auc: 0.558\n44\t    S3_d005_3B_gsm8k_auc: 0.543\n45\t    S3_d005_3B_arc_auc: 0.578\n46\t    S4_d005_3B_mmlu_auc: 0.542\n47\t    S4_d005_3B_gsm8k_auc: 0.525\n48\t    S4_d005_3B_arc_auc: 0.558\n49\t    S1_d100_15B_cohens_d_mean: 3.15\n50\t    S2_d100_15B_cohens_d_mean: -1.45\n51\t    S4_d100_15B_cohens_d_mean: 0.38\n52\t    S1_d100_3B_cohens_d_mean: 3.52\n53\t    S2_d100_3B_cohens_d_mean: -1.63\n54\t    S4_d100_3B_cohens_d_mean: 0.52\n55\t    S1_d005_multiscale_auc_mean: 0.974\n56\t    S2_d005_multiscale_auc_mean: 0.5\n57\t    S4_d005_multiscale_auc_mean: 0.514\n58\t    effective_signals_all_scales: 1\n59\t    computation_time_hours: 16\n60\t  result_rationale: 'S1 (Embedding) 是外部模型 (sentence-transformers) 计算的语义相似度，不依赖 target\n61\t    model 的内部表示，因此 scale-invariant——0.5B/1.5B/3B 的 AUC 稳定在 0.95-0.99。S2 (Min-K++)\n62\t    依赖 target model 的 token-level perplexity 来区分 seen vs unseen items，但 LoRA SFT 仅修改\n63\t    ~1% 参数，对 perplexity 分布影响极微； 加之 paraphrase 改变了 surface form，Min-K++ 无法通过精确 token\n64\t    匹配检测。1.5B/3B 的 S2 AUC 微升至 0.50-0.55（更大模型 perplexity 分布稍更尖锐），但远未达有效 阈值（0.70+）。S4\n65\t    (Self-Critique) 要求模型内省判断哪些 items 被\"记住\"，0.5B-3B 模型的元认知能力不足以可靠区分 contaminated vs\n66\t    clean items。S3 (ConStat) 依赖 原题 vs 改写题的得分差异，但 1.5B/3B 的 contamination inflation\n67\t    极小（<2pp）， ConStat 检测不到显著 gap。Min-K++ 方向性反转在 1.5B/3B 持续存在：高污染下模型 对 contaminated\n68\t    items 的 Min-K++ score 反而更低（LoRA adaptation 降低了这些 items 的 surprise），导致 signal 指向错误方向。\n69\t\n70\t    '\n71\t  tables:\n72\t  - name: 'Table: Signal × Scale AUC Heatmap (d005, within-model)'\n73\t    data:\n74\t      headers:\n75\t      - signal\n76\t      - 0.5B_mmlu\n77\t      - 0.5B_gsm8k\n78\t      - 0.5B_arc\n79\t      - 1.5B_mmlu\n80\t      - 1.5B_gsm8k\n81\t      - 1.5B_arc\n82\t      - 3B_mmlu\n83\t      - 3B_gsm8k\n84\t      - 3B_arc\n85\t      rows:\n86\t      - - S1_Embedding\n87\t        - 0.953\n88\t        - 0.988\n89\t        - 0.995\n90\t        - 0.961\n91\t        - 0.978\n92\t        - 0.99\n93\t        - 0.955\n94\t        - 0.972\n95\t        - 0.986\n96\t      - - S2_MinKPP\n97\t        - 0.466\n98\t        - 0.465\n99\t        - 0.466\n100\t        - 0.502\n101\t        - 0.489\n102\t        - 0.515\n103\t        - 0.538\n104\t        - 0.512\n105\t        - 0.552\n106\t      - - S3_ConStat\n107\t        - 0.52\n108\t        - 0.51\n109\t        - 0.54\n110\t        - 0.535\n111\t        - 0.52\n112\t        - 0.548\n113\t        - 0.558\n114\t        - 0.543\n115\t        - 0.578\n116\t      - - S4_SelfCritique\n117\t        - 0.517\n118\t        - 0.495\n119\t        - 0.433\n120\t        - 0.523\n121\t        - 0.508\n122\t        - 0.537\n123\t        - 0.542\n124\t        - 0.525\n125\t        - 0.558\n126\t  - name: 'Table: Min-K++ Directional Reversal (d100 cross-model Cohen''s d)'\n127\t    data:\n128\t      headers:\n129\t      - scale\n130\t      - mmlu\n131\t      - gsm8k\n132\t      - arc\n133\t      - mean\n134\t      rows:\n135\t      - - 0.5B\n136\t        - -1.22\n137\t        - -2.67\n138\t        - -2.05\n139\t        - -1.98\n140\t      - - 1.5B\n141\t        - -1.05\n142\t        - -1.82\n143\t        - -1.48\n144\t        - -1.45\n145\t      - - 3B\n146\t        - -1.15\n147\t        - -2.1\n148\t        - -1.65\n149\t        - -1.63\n150\t  figures_description:\n151\t  - 'Signal × Scale × Benchmark AUC heatmap (3 signals × 3 scales × 3 benchmarks)。\n152\t    颜色编码 AUC：深绿 (>0.90) 仅出现在 S1 行，其余行全部浅红/灰 (<0.60)。 视觉上立即传达 \"only embedding works\"\n153\t    的核心信息。\n154\t\n155\t    '\n156\t  - 'Min-K++ d100 cross-model effect size 柱状图：3 scales × 3 benchmarks， 所有柱子向下延伸（负值），颜色由\n157\t    scale 区分。Caption 强调方向性反转。\n158\t\n159\t    '\n160\t  analysis: '核心发现确认：S2/S4 在 1.5B/3B 未恢复有效性，''scale-dependent'' claim 无法支撑， 必须降级为 ''method-specific''。S2\n161\t    从 0.5B 的 0.465 微升至 3B 的 0.531，统计上 仍为 chance level。S4 类似（0.481→0.542）。S3 (ConStat)\n162\t    也始终低于 0.60， 因为 contamination 对 1.5B/3B 的 overall accuracy 影响极小 (<2pp)，原题 vs 改写题的\n163\t    performance gap 淹没在 noise 中。Min-K++ 方向性反转在所有 scale 持续， Cohen''s d 从 0.5B 的 -1.98\n164\t    变为 3B 的 -1.63——反转幅度随 scale 略减但始终显著 (p<0.001)。这意味着使用 Min-K++ 作为 contamination signal\n165\t    不仅无效，而且会 actively mislead——将 contaminated items 标记为 clean。此 finding 对 detection\n166\t    community 有独立价值。S1 的 scale-invariance (AUC 0.95-0.99) 的理论解释： embedding similarity\n167\t    由 external sentence-transformer 计算，与 target model 的 training 无关，因此不受 scale/regime\n168\t    影响。\n169\t\n170\t    '\n171\t- name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n172\t  plan_id: exp-003\n173\t  description: 'RRF fusion 及 ablations。0.5B RRF 已完成 (exp_003_rrf_05B)，此处扩展至 全 scale\n174\t    并完成完整 ablation matrix。\n175\t\n176\t    '\n177\t  expected_results:\n178\t    rrf_4signal_d005_05B_auc: 0.944\n179\t    rrf_4signal_d005_15B_auc: 0.95\n180\t    rrf_4signal_d005_3B_auc: 0.948\n181\t    s1_only_d005_05B_auc: 0.979\n182\t    s1_only_d005_15B_auc: 0.976\n183\t    s1_only_d005_3B_auc: 0.971\n184\t    s2_only_d005_auc_mean: 0.5\n185\t    s3_only_d005_auc_mean: 0.537\n186\t    s4_only_d005_auc_mean: 0.514\n187\t    equal_weight_rank_avg_d005_auc: 0.938\n188\t    calibration_weighted_rrf_d005_auc: 0.96\n189\t    rrf_2signal_d005_auc: 0.53\n190\t    rrf4_vs_s1_spearman: 0.962\n191\t    rrf_fp_1x_auc: 0.928\n192\t    rrf_fp_2x_auc: 0.895\n193\t    rrf4_vs_s1_delta_auc: -0.03\n194\t  result_rationale: 'RRF 将 4 signals 的排名通过 1/(k+rank) 融合。当 S2/S3/S4 为 random（AUC~0.50），\n195\t    它们对每个 item 贡献相近的 RRF 分数（均匀分布在 rank 空间），相当于添加 constant + noise。S1 的 discriminative\n196\t    ranking 占据主导。具体：contaminated item 的 S1 rank 极低（e.g., top 5%），贡献 1/(60+rank) ≈\n197\t    0.016，远大于 random signals 的 贡献（~0.0001）。因此 RRF-4 的 exposure ranking 与 S1-only 的\n198\t    Spearman 相关达 0.96，RRF-4 AUC 仅比 S1 低 0.02-0.03（random signals 的 noise 引入微量 rank\n199\t    扰动）。Calibration-weighted RRF 通过降低 S2/S3/S4 权重接近 S1-only（AUC 0.96 vs 0.979），但仍不如直接用\n200\t    S1。Equal-weight rank averaging 效果略差于 RRF 因为 RRF 的 1/(k+rank) 形式天然上调 top-ranked\n201\t    items 的 influence。2-signal closed-weight mode (S3+S4) 的 AUC 0.53 几乎等于 chance——两个\n202\t    random signals 的 fusion 仍然 random。FP injection 降低了 S1 的 precision，连带拉低 RRF：1×\n203\t    FP 使 AUC 降至 0.928，2× 降至 0.895，但仍远优于其他 signals。\n204\t\n205\t    '\n206\t  tables:\n207\t  - name: 'Table: Aggregation Method Comparison (d005 AUC)'\n208\t    data:\n209\t      headers:\n210\t      - method\n211\t      - 0.5B\n212\t      - 1.5B\n213\t      - 3B\n214\t      - mean\n215\t      rows:\n216\t      - - S1-only\n217\t        - 0.979\n218\t        - 0.976\n219\t        - 0.971\n220\t        - 0.975\n221\t      - - RRF-4 (all signals)\n222\t        - 0.944\n223\t        - 0.95\n224\t        - 0.948\n225\t        - 0.947\n226\t      - - Calibration-weighted RRF\n227\t        - 0.958\n228\t        - 0.962\n229\t        - 0.96\n230\t        - 0.96\n231\t      - - Equal-weight averaging\n232\t        - 0.935\n233\t        - 0.94\n234\t        - 0.938\n235\t        - 0.938\n236\t      - - S2-only (Min-K++)\n237\t        - 0.465\n238\t        - 0.502\n239\t        - 0.531\n240\t        - 0.499\n241\t      - - S3-only (ConStat)\n242\t        - 0.523\n243\t        - 0.534\n244\t        - 0.56\n245\t        - 0.539\n246\t      - - S4-only (Self-Critique)\n247\t        - 0.481\n248\t        - 0.523\n249\t        - 0.542\n250\t        - 0.515\n251\t      - - RRF-2 (S3+S4)\n252\t        - 0.51\n253\t        - 0.53\n254\t        - 0.548\n255\t        - 0.529\n256\t  figures_description:\n257\t  - 'Ablation 柱状图：各 aggregation method 的 AUC，按 scale 分组。S1-only 柱子 最高，RRF-4 紧随，其余远低。标注\n258\t    RRF-4 vs S1 的 delta。\n259\t\n260\t    '\n261\t  - 'Exposure score scatter: RRF-4 vs S1-only per-item scores，Spearman ρ=0.96 标注在图上。几乎在\n262\t    y=x 线上，说明 RRF ≈ S1。\n263\t\n264\t    '\n265\t  analysis: 'RRF 在 \"all constituent signals work\" 前提下是 principled 的 aggregation choice，\n266\t    但当 3/4 signals 为 random 时退化为 S1-dominated mode。实质贡献为零：使用 RRF-4 反而比 S1-only 损失\n267\t    ~3pp AUC。Calibration-weighted RRF (学习 signal weights) 能部分恢复，但需要 labeled data 来学\n268\t    weights——引入 meta-circularity（用 potentially contaminated data 来学 contamination\n269\t    detector 的 weights）。这正是 论文使用 training-free RRF 而非 learned aggregation 的理由。Closed-weight\n270\t    2-signal mode (AUC 0.53) 对 API-only 模型几乎无用——paper 应诚实报告此为 fundamental limitation\n271\t    而非 \"degraded mode\"。RRF 的 FP robustness 检查表明即使 注入 2× FP，AUC 仍>0.89，因为 RRF 的 rank-based\n272\t    形式天然对 outlier scores 有 robustness。Paper 推荐：在 Method section 保留 RRF 作为 default\n273\t    aggregation （principled + robust），但在 Results 显示 S1-only 与 RRF-4 无显著差异，将 RRF vs\n274\t    S1 的 non-improvement 移入 Limitations 并保留 meta-circularity defense。\n275\t\n276\t    '\n277\t- name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n278\t  plan_id: exp-006\n279\t  description: '核心实验。在 exp-001/003 产出上 fit 4PL+γ IRT，比较 7 baselines。 Per-benchmark\n280\t    fitting (γ_k) 为 primary；joint fitting (global γ) 为 ablation。 含 measurement error\n281\t    model (from exp-005) 的 coverage 对比。\n282\t\n283\t    '\n284\t  expected_results:\n285\t    calibration_MAE_pp_4pl_gamma: 4.3\n286\t    calibration_MAE_pp_4pl_gamma_bootstrap_ci:\n287\t    - 3.1\n288\t    - 5.5\n289\t    calibration_MAE_pp_linear_reg: 4.8\n290\t    calibration_MAE_pp_linear_reg_ci:\n291\t    - 3.5\n292\t    - 6.1\n293\t    calibration_MAE_pp_single_2pl_gamma: 4.6\n294\t    calibration_MAE_pp_single_2pl_gamma_ci:\n295\t    - 3.3\n296\t    - 5.9\n297\t    calibration_MAE_pp_remove_rescore: 5.5\n298\t    calibration_MAE_pp_dcr: 5.2\n299\t    calibration_MAE_pp_vanilla_4pl: 6.0\n300\t    calibration_MAE_pp_emperor_rephrase: 6.5\n301\t    calibration_MAE_pp_emperor_shuffle: 6.8\n302\t    calibration_MAE_pp_raw: 7.2\n303\t    mae_4pl_mmlu_pp: 3.8\n304\t    mae_4pl_gsm8k_pp: 5.2\n305\t    mae_4pl_arc_pp: 4.0\n306\t    mae_4pl_humaneval_pp: 7.5\n307\t    mae_raw_mmlu_pp: 4.2\n308\t    mae_raw_gsm8k_pp: 12.8\n309\t    mae_raw_arc_pp: 5.5\n310\t    CI_coverage_95_with_ME: 0.85\n311\t    CI_coverage_80_with_ME: 0.73\n312\t    CI_coverage_50_with_ME: 0.46\n313\t    CI_coverage_95_without_ME: 0.77\n314\t    CI_coverage_80_without_ME: 0.65\n315\t    CI_coverage_50_without_ME: 0.4\n316\t    CI_coverage_95_linear_reg: 0.72\n317\t    CI_width_avg_pp_with_ME: 8.5\n318\t    CI_width_avg_pp_without_ME: 6.8\n319\t    CI_width_avg_pp_linear_reg: 5.2\n320\t    kendall_tau_4pl_gamma: 0.85\n321\t    kendall_tau_raw: 0.82\n322\t    kendall_tau_linear_reg: 0.84\n323\t    dose_response_monotonicity_mmlu: 0.83\n324\t    dose_response_monotonicity_gsm8k: 0.68\n325\t    dose_response_monotonicity_arc: 0.78\n326\t    dose_response_monotonicity_avg: 0.76\n327\t    gamma_mmlu_mean: 0.12\n328\t    gamma_mmlu_ci:\n329\t    - -0.03\n330\t    - 0.27\n331\t    gamma_gsm8k_mean: 1.85\n332\t    gamma_gsm8k_ci:\n333\t    - 0.9\n334\t    - 2.8\n335\t    gamma_arc_mean: 0.08\n336\t    gamma_arc_ci:\n337\t    - -0.08\n338\t    - 0.24\n339\t    gamma_humaneval_mean: 0.15\n340\t    gamma_humaneval_ci:\n341\t    - -0.2\n342\t    - 0.5\n343\t    global_gamma_mean: 0.35\n344\t    global_gamma_ci:\n345\t    - 0.15\n346\t    - 0.55\n347\t    global_gamma_MAE_pp: 5.8\n348\t    max_rhat: 1.008\n349\t    min_ess_bulk: 800\n350\t    divergent_pct: 0.2\n351\t    mean_residual_item_correlation: 0.08\n352\t    residual_correlation_95th_pct: 0.15\n353\t  result_rationale: '4PL+γ 的 overall MAE (4.3pp) 主要由三个 regime 驱动：(1) 0.5B regression\n354\t    regime — contamination SFT 导致小模型能力退化 7-15pp (MMLU) / 14-17pp (ARC)，IRT 正确 识别 contaminated\n355\t    items 的 γ boost 但无法修复 θ degradation，counterfactual prediction 反映 degraded θ，MAE\n356\t    ≈ Raw MAE (~10-13pp)。这是 fundamental limitation： IRT 校准的是 \"如果没看过 test items 成绩会怎样\"，但\n357\t    θ 本身已被 contaminated SFT irreversibly 改变。(2) 1.5B/3B MMLU/ARC regime — contamination\n358\t    inflation 极小 (<2pp)，所有 methods 的 MAE 都低 (<1pp)，4PL+γ 无显著优势。(3) 3B GSM8K format\n359\t    confound regime — d000→d100 跳升 58pp，但主因是 clean SFT 导致 GSM8K catastrophic forgetting\n360\t    (base 60.5%→SFT 12%)，contamination SFT 恢复格式能力。 γ_GSM8K 估计值 1.85 (logit scale)\n361\t    巨大，counterfactual 大幅下调 d100 预测至 ~12-15%，接近 d000 ground truth (12%)。这是 4PL+γ 的最大\n362\t    MAE 改进来源（Raw MAE 33pp → 4PL+γ MAE ~5pp on 3B GSM8K）。但 intermediate dosages (d005/d025)\n363\t    存在 format spillover：即使少量 contamination items 也部分教会 format，使 unexposed items accuracy\n364\t    上升→ θ 被高估→ counterfactual over-predicts。MAE 4.3pp vs linear reg 4.8pp 和 single-2PL\n365\t    4.6pp 的差异落在 bootstrap CI 重叠区间内，因为 所有三种方法都 capture 了 GSM8K 的主要 exposure-accuracy\n366\t    关系，差异仅来自 IRT 的更灵活 item modeling (c, d parameters)。Coverage 0.85 (with ME) vs nominal\n367\t    0.95 的 gap 来自两个来源：(a) local independence violation — 单模型的所有 item responses 通过\n368\t    shared parameters 相关，standard IRT 假设 independence 导致 CIs 系统性偏窄； (b) single γ per\n369\t    benchmark 无法捕获 scale-specific contamination effects（0.5B 的负效应 vs 3B 的正效应被同一个 γ\n370\t    平均）。Measurement error model 通过 widening CIs ~25% (6.8pp→8.5pp) 将 coverage 从 0.77\n371\t    提升至 0.85，但 widening 是 uniform 的——理想情况应 scale-dependent (高 AUC models 的 CI 更窄)。Kendall\n372\t    τ = 0.85 对比 Raw 0.82 因为 GSM8K 的 large contamination effect 在 3B 会 swap 模型排名 （d100\n373\t    3B GSM8K 70% vs d000 12%），calibration 修复了这个 swap。Dose-response monotonicity 在\n374\t    MMLU (0.83) 和 ARC (0.78) 尚可，但 GSM8K (0.68) 偏低—— format learning 的非线性 dose-response（少量\n375\t    contamination 已教会大部分 format） 使得 γ*exposure 的线性假设不成立。\n376\t\n377\t    '\n378\t  tables:\n379\t  - name: 'Table 3 (Main): Calibration MAE (pp) by Method and Benchmark'\n380\t    data:\n381\t      headers:\n382\t      - method\n383\t      - MMLU\n384\t      - GSM8K\n385\t      - ARC\n386\t      - Average\n387\t      - 95% CI\n388\t      - has_UQ\n389\t      rows:\n390\t      - - 4PL+γ (ours)\n391\t        - 3.8\n392\t        - 5.2\n393\t        - 4.0\n394\t        - 4.3\n395\t        - '[3.1, 5.5]'\n396\t        - true\n397\t      - - Single-signal 2PL+γ\n398\t        - 3.9\n399\t        - 5.5\n400\t        - 4.3\n401\t        - 4.6\n402\t        - '[3.3, 5.9]'\n403\t        - true\n404\t      - - Linear reg + bootstrap\n405\t        - 4.0\n406\t        - 5.8\n407\t        - 4.5\n408\t        - 4.8\n409\t        - '[3.5, 6.1]'\n410\t        - true\n411\t      - - DCR (EMNLP 2025)\n412\t        - 4.0\n413\t        - 6.5\n414\t        - 5.0\n415\t        - 5.2\n416\t        - —\n417\t        - false\n418\t      - - Remove-and-rescore\n419\t        - 4.2\n420\t        - 7.0\n421\t        - 5.2\n422\t        - 5.5\n423\t        - —\n424\t        - false\n425\t      - - Vanilla 4PL (no γ)\n426\t        - 4.1\n427\t        - 9.2\n428\t        - 4.8\n429\t        - 6.0\n430\t        - —\n431\t        - false\n432\t      - - Emperor-rephrase\n433\t        - 4.0\n434\t        - 10.8\n435\t        - 5.0\n436\t        - 6.5\n437\t        - —\n438\t        - false\n439\t      - - Emperor-shuffle\n440\t        - 4.2\n441\t        - 11.5\n442\t        - 5.2\n443\t        - 6.8\n444\t        - —\n445\t        - false\n446\t      - - Raw (no adjustment)\n447\t        - 4.2\n448\t        - 12.8\n449\t        - 5.5\n450\t        - 7.2\n451\t        - —\n452\t        - false\n453\t  - name: 'Table 4: Credible Interval Coverage and Sharpness'\n454\t    data:\n455\t      headers:\n456\t      - method\n457\t      - Cov@50%\n458\t      - Cov@80%\n459\t      - Cov@95%\n460\t      - Width (pp)\n461\t      rows:\n462\t      - - 4PL+γ + ME model\n463\t        - 0.46\n464\t        - 0.73\n465\t        - 0.85\n466\t        - 8.5\n467\t      - - 4PL+γ (point exposure)\n468\t        - 0.4\n469\t        - 0.65\n470\t        - 0.77\n471\t        - 6.8\n472\t      - - Linear reg + bootstrap\n473\t        - 0.35\n474\t        - 0.58\n475\t        - 0.72\n476\t        - 5.2\n477\t  - name: 'Table 5: Per-Benchmark γ_k Estimates'\n478\t    data:\n479\t      headers:\n480\t      - benchmark\n481\t      - γ_k (logit)\n482\t      - 95% CI\n483\t      - CI excludes 0?\n484\t      - interpretation\n485\t      rows:\n486\t      - - MMLU\n487\t        - 0.12\n488\t        - '[-0.03, 0.27]'\n489\t        - 'No'\n490\t        - Marginal contamination effect\n491\t      - - GSM8K\n492\t        - 1.85\n493\t        - '[0.90, 2.80]'\n494\t        - 'Yes'\n495\t        - Large — confounded by format learning\n496\t      - - ARC\n497\t        - 0.08\n498\t        - '[-0.08, 0.24]'\n499\t        - 'No'\n500\t        - Negligible contamination effect\n501\t      - - HumanEval\n502\t        - 0.15\n503\t        - '[-0.20, 0.50]'\n504\t        - 'No'\n505\t        - Unreliable (N=164, low QC)\n506\t  - name: 'Table S1 (Appendix): Per-Scale MAE Breakdown for 4PL+γ (pp)'\n507\t    data:\n508\t      headers:\n509\t      - scale\n510\t      - MMLU\n511\t      - GSM8K\n512\t      - ARC\n513\t      - note\n514\t      rows:\n515\t      - - 0.5B\n516\t        - 10.2\n517\t        - 0.8\n518\t        - 12.5\n519\t        - Dominated by SFT ability regression\n520\t      - - 1.5B\n521\t        - 0.6\n522\t        - 0.5\n523\t        - 0.4\n524\t        - Minimal contamination effect\n525\t      - - 3B\n526\t        - 0.5\n527\t        - 5.2\n528\t        - 0.8\n529\t        - 'GSM8K: format confound partially corrected'\n530\t  figures_description:\n531\t  - 'Fig 5: Calibrated-vs-true accuracy scatter (per-model per-benchmark dots) with\n532\t    95% CIs as error bars。Perfect calibration = diagonal line。4PL+γ points cluster\n533\t    near diagonal with CIs spanning it (coverage 0.85)。Highlight: 0.5B points systematically\n534\t    below diagonal (under-prediction from θ regression)； 3B GSM8K d100 point dramatically\n535\t    corrected from far off-diagonal (Raw) to near-diagonal (calibrated)。\n536\t\n537\t    '\n538\t  - 'Fig 3: Dose-response curves — 3 panels (MMLU, GSM8K, ARC)。X-axis: dosage (0%→100%)。Y-axis:\n539\t    accuracy。Each scale as separate line。Overlaid: 4PL+γ predicted counterfactual\n540\t    (dashed horizontal line at θ level) with CI band。 GSM8K panel shows non-linear\n541\t    jump (format confound annotation)。\n542\t\n543\t    '\n544\t  - 'Fig S2: Coverage calibration plot — observed coverage (y) vs nominal coverage\n545\t    (x) for 4PL+γ variants。With ME: curve below diagonal but close at 95%； without\n546\t    ME: curve further below; linear reg bootstrap: lowest。\n547\t\n548\t    '\n549\t  analysis: 'exp-006 confirms the median-tier story：4PL+γ 在 point estimate accuracy\n550\t    上 对 Raw/Emperor/Vanilla-4PL 有 clear improvement (2-3pp MAE reduction)，主要来自 GSM8K@3B\n551\t    的 format inflation correction。但对 linear regression 和 single-signal 2PL+γ 的优势 marginal\n552\t    (0.3-0.5pp, within bootstrap CI overlap)。这并不意味着 4PL+γ 无价值——其 unique contribution\n553\t    是 UQ：(1) credible intervals coverage 0.85 虽未达 nominal 但大幅优于 bootstrap CI 0.72；(2)\n554\t    per-benchmark γ_k 提供了 contamination effect 的 interpretable quantification——γ_GSM8K=1.85\n555\t    vs γ_MMLU=0.12 揭示 contamination susceptibility 的 benchmark heterogeneity；(3) CIs\n556\t    自动 widen for models with poor signal quality (measurement error model)。Per-benchmark\n557\t    vs joint fitting ablation 表明 γ heterogeneity 显著：global γ=0.35 的 MAE (5.8pp) 显著差于\n558\t    per-benchmark (4.3pp)，支持 per-benchmark fitting 为 primary。HumanEval 的 γ CI 包含 0，与\n559\t    QC pass rate 仅 16% 一致——不足以支撑 contamination claim， relegated to appendix。Posterior\n560\t    predictive check 显示 mean residual item correlation 0.08（理想值 0）——local independence\n561\t    violation 的 empirical evidence， 需在 Limitations 讨论。三个 key limitations：(1) 0.5B\n562\t    ability regression 不可 calibrate；(2) GSM8K format confound 使 γ 估计混淆 contamination\n563\t    和 format learning；(3) Coverage gap 10pp (0.85 vs 0.95) 表明 CIs 系统性偏窄。\n564\t\n565\t    '\n566\t- name: scale_bridging_7b\n567\t  plan_id: exp-007\n568\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B controlled SFT injection at 5 dosage levels。 验证 calibration\n569\t    accuracy 是否 scale 到更大模型。\n570\t\n571\t    '\n572\t  expected_results:\n573\t    eval_7B_d000_mmlu: 0.703\n574\t    eval_7B_d000_gsm8k: 0.765\n575\t    eval_7B_d000_arc: 0.882\n576\t    eval_7B_d005_mmlu: 0.705\n577\t    eval_7B_d005_gsm8k: 0.768\n578\t    eval_7B_d005_arc: 0.884\n579\t    eval_7B_d025_mmlu: 0.708\n580\t    eval_7B_d025_gsm8k: 0.775\n581\t    eval_7B_d025_arc: 0.886\n582\t    eval_7B_d050_mmlu: 0.71\n583\t    eval_7B_d050_gsm8k: 0.782\n584\t    eval_7B_d050_arc: 0.887\n585\t    eval_7B_d100_mmlu: 0.715\n586\t    eval_7B_d100_gsm8k: 0.795\n587\t    eval_7B_d100_arc: 0.89\n588\t    inflation_7B_mmlu_pp: 1.2\n589\t    inflation_7B_gsm8k_pp: 3.0\n590\t    inflation_7B_arc_pp: 0.8\n591\t    S1_d005_7B_auc: 0.965\n592\t    S2_d005_7B_auc: 0.555\n593\t    S4_d005_7B_auc: 0.548\n594\t    S2_d100_7B_cohens_d: -1.35\n595\t    calibration_MAE_7B_4pl_gamma: 1.2\n596\t    calibration_MAE_7B_raw: 1.7\n597\t    sft_7B_time_per_run_hours: 10.5\n598\t    sft_7B_gpu_budget_total_hours: 28\n599\t  result_rationale: '7B 模型能力足够高，contamination inflation 极小 (1-3pp) 且与 clean SFT 噪声\n600\t    comparable。MMLU 0.703→0.715 (+1.2pp)：模型已掌握大部分 MMLU 知识， memorization 的 marginal\n601\t    benefit 微弱。GSM8K 0.765→0.795 (+3.0pp)：7B 的 SFT baseline 已经 handle format well（不像\n602\t    3B 的 catastrophic forgetting），所以 contamination effect 是 genuine memorization 而非\n603\t    format recovery。ARC +0.8pp is within noise。S1 at 7B maintains high AUC (0.965)——embedding\n604\t    similarity 与 target model scale 无关。S2 at 7B 微升至 0.555 但仍远低于有效阈值——7B 模型的 perplexity\n605\t    landscape 稍更 structured 但 LoRA 的 parameter footprint 仍然太小 to leave detectable\n606\t    perplexity signature。Min-K++ 方向性反转持续 (d=-1.35)。 Calibration MAE 1.2pp at 7B reflects\n607\t    the ceiling effect：当 contamination inflation 仅 1-3pp 时，所有 calibration methods\n608\t    的 MAE 都很低，improvement 空间有限。7B data point 的主要价值是：(1) 证明 pipeline scales to 7B without\n609\t    degradation；(2) 排除 larger models 可能出现的 new failure modes；(3) 扩充 IRT fitting 的\n610\t    model pool（now 4 scales × 5 dosages = 60 models），改善 γ estimation precision。\n611\t\n612\t    '\n613\t  tables:\n614\t  - name: 'Table: 7B Dose-Response Evaluation Scores'\n615\t    data:\n616\t      headers:\n617\t      - dosage\n618\t      - MMLU\n619\t      - GSM8K\n620\t      - ARC\n621\t      rows:\n622\t      - - 0%\n623\t        - 0.703\n624\t        - 0.765\n625\t        - 0.882\n626\t      - - 5%\n627\t        - 0.705\n628\t        - 0.768\n629\t        - 0.884\n630\t      - - 25%\n631\t        - 0.708\n632\t        - 0.775\n633\t        - 0.886\n634\t      - - 50%\n635\t        - 0.71\n636\t        - 0.782\n637\t        - 0.887\n638\t      - - 100%\n639\t        - 0.715\n640\t        - 0.795\n641\t        - 0.89\n642\t  figures_description:\n643\t  - 'Dose-response 扩展图：原有 0.5B/1.5B/3B curves 加入 7B line。7B 是最高的 几乎 flat 线，visually\n644\t    传达 \"大模型 contamination effect 极小\" 的信息。\n645\t\n646\t    '\n647\t  analysis: '7B 结果强化了 contamination effect 的 scale-dependent heterogeneity narrative：\n648\t    (1) 0.5B: contamination HURTS (ability regression)；(2) 1.5B: no effect； (3) 3B:\n649\t    GSM8K format recovery dominates；(4) 7B: genuine but tiny memorization benefit\n650\t    (1-3pp)。只有 7B 展示了 \"clean\" contamination inflation story（无 format confound，无 ability\n651\t    regression）。但 effect size 太小 (1-3pp)，calibration improvement 相应 marginal。For the\n652\t    paper：7B 是 strongest 支持 calibration claim 的 scale（no confounds），但 improvement\n653\t    最小。建议在 Results 中 highlight 7B 作为 \"ideal case\" 然后讨论 smaller scales 的 complications。\n654\t\n655\t    '\n656\t- name: signal_survival_analysis\n657\t  plan_id: exp-008\n658\t  description: 'Detection signal reliability 的 systematic multi-scale evaluation。\n659\t    0.5B v4 已完成，扩展至 1.5B/3B 和 Instruct-proxy RL 分析。\n660\t\n661\t    '\n662\t  expected_results:\n663\t    S1_d005_auc_multiscale_mean: 0.974\n664\t    S2_d005_auc_multiscale_mean: 0.5\n665\t    S3_d005_auc_multiscale_mean: 0.537\n666\t    S4_d005_auc_multiscale_mean: 0.514\n667\t    S2_instruct_05B_auc_d005: 0.488\n668\t    S4_instruct_05B_auc_d005: 0.505\n669\t    S1_instruct_05B_auc_d005: 0.942\n670\t    S2_d100_cohens_d_all_scales:\n671\t    - -1.22\n672\t    - -1.45\n673\t    - -1.63\n674\t    S2_d100_cohens_d_mean: -1.43\n675\t    minkpp_reversal_consistent_across_scales: true\n676\t    S1_d005_cross_model_d_mean: 2.45\n677\t    S1_d025_cross_model_d_mean: 3.8\n678\t    S1_d100_cross_model_d_mean: 3.6\n679\t    scale_dependent_claim_supported: false\n680\t    method_specific_claim_supported: true\n681\t    effective_signals_at_all_scales: 1\n682\t  result_rationale: '信号生存分析的核心结论与 exp-002 一致（数据本质相同，但 exp-008 focus 在 regime 比较和 statistical\n683\t    testing 上）。Instruct-model proxy test 使用 Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct 作为 RL-trained model\n684\t    proxy（RLHF/DPO 过的模型）。S1 在 Instruct 模型上维持 高 AUC (0.942) 因为 embedding similarity\n685\t    不受 target model 训练 regime 影响。 S2 在 Instruct 模型上 AUC 0.488（略低于 SFT 的 0.465，在 noise\n686\t    范围内）—— RLHF 并不帮助 Min-K++ recover contamination signal。S4 在 Instruct 上 0.505 也无改善。S1\n687\t    的 cross-model effect size 在 d005 (2.45) 低于 d100 (3.60) 因为 d005 只有 5% items contaminated，cross-model\n688\t    mean shift 更小。d100 vs d025 的 effect size 相近 (3.60 vs 3.80) 表明 S1 的 discriminability\n689\t    在高 dosage 已 saturate。Min-K++ reversal 的 Cohen''s d 在三个 scale 分别为 -1.22, -1.45,\n690\t    -1.63——reversed 幅度随 scale 增加（更大模型的 LoRA adaptation 对 contaminated items 的 perplexity\n691\t    影响更大，加剧反转）。\n692\t\n693\t    '\n694\t  tables:\n695\t  - name: 'Table 2 (Paper): Signal × Scale Effectiveness Summary'\n696\t    data:\n697\t      headers:\n698\t      - signal\n699\t      - mechanism\n700\t      - 0.5B AUC\n701\t      - 1.5B AUC\n702\t      - 3B AUC\n703\t      - Instruct AUC\n704\t      - verdict\n705\t      rows:\n706\t      - - S1 Embedding\n707\t        - External similarity\n708\t        - 0.979\n709\t        - 0.976\n710\t        - 0.971\n711\t        - 0.942\n712\t        - Effective\n713\t      - - S2 Min-K++\n714\t        - Token perplexity\n715\t        - 0.465\n716\t        - 0.502\n717\t        - 0.531\n718\t        - 0.488\n719\t        - Failed + reversed\n720\t      - - S3 ConStat\n721\t        - Performance gap\n722\t        - 0.523\n723\t        - 0.534\n724\t        - 0.56\n725\t        - —\n726\t        - Failed\n727\t      - - S4 Self-Critique\n728\t        - Entropy collapse\n729\t        - 0.481\n730\t        - 0.523\n731\t        - 0.542\n732\t        - 0.505\n733\t        - Failed\n734\t  - name: 'Table: Min-K++ Reversal Evidence'\n735\t    data:\n736\t      headers:\n737\t      - scale\n738\t      - d100 Cohen's d (MMLU)\n739\t      - d100 Cohen's d (GSM8K)\n740\t      - d100 Cohen's d (ARC)\n741\t      - mean\n742\t      - p-value\n743\t      rows:\n744\t      - - 0.5B\n745\t        - -1.22\n746\t        - -2.67\n747\t        - -2.05\n748\t        - -1.98\n749\t        - <1e-100\n750\t      - - 1.5B\n751\t        - -1.05\n752\t        - -1.82\n753\t        - -1.48\n754\t        - -1.45\n755\t        - <1e-80\n756\t      - - 3B\n757\t        - -1.15\n758\t        - -2.1\n759\t        - -1.65\n760\t        - -1.63\n761\t        - <1e-90\n762\t  figures_description:\n763\t  - 'Fig 2 (Paper): AUC heatmap — rows: 4 signals + Instruct proxy, columns: 3 scales\n764\t    × 3 benchmarks。S1 row 全深绿，其余 rows 全灰/浅红。最直观的 main figure。\n765\t\n766\t    '\n767\t  - 'Fig S1: Min-K++ score distributions for d000 vs d100 per scale。Violin plots showing\n768\t    d100 distribution LOWER than d000 (reversed direction)。p-values annotated。\n769\t\n770\t    '\n771\t  analysis: 'exp-008 提供 Paper Claim 2 的全部 empirical evidence。核心 narrative 变为 \"method-specific\n772\t    signal failure modes\"：(1) Embedding is the only reliable signal across all scales\n773\t    and regimes (AUC>0.94)；(2) Min-K++ not only fails but actively misleads (directional\n774\t    reversal at all scales, Cohen''s d -1.0 to -2.7)；(3) Self-Critique and ConStat\n775\t    are consistently at chance level。''Scale-dependent'' claim 被放弃因为 1.5B/3B 的 S2/S4\n776\t    AUC 仍<0.60——scale 增加并未恢复信号。 Min-K++ reversal 作为 independent finding 有 significant\n777\t    value：它 challenges the widespread assumption that Min-K++ \"degrades gracefully\"\n778\t    — 实际上它 degrades catastrophically by flipping direction, which is worse than random\n779\t    (negative AUC is dangerous if used as positive evidence)。Instruct proxy test 表明\n780\t    RL post-training 不改变 signal landscape——这是 cautiously positive news for exp-009\n781\t    (observational study)，但也意味着 RL 不帮助 weak signals recover。\n782\t\n783\t    '\n784\t- name: rl_observational_case_study\n785\t  plan_id: exp-009\n786\t  description: '对现有 RL-trained 模型（Qwen2.5-Instruct, DeepSeek-R1-Distill）应用 calibration\n787\t    pipeline。No controlled ground truth——observational external validity。\n788\t\n789\t    '\n790\t  expected_results:\n791\t    primary_signal_for_observational: S2 + S3 + S4 (no S1 access)\n792\t    effective_signal_auc_observational: 0.53\n793\t    gamma_mmlu_rl_models: 0.1\n794\t    gamma_mmlu_rl_ci:\n795\t    - -0.25\n796\t    - 0.45\n797\t    gamma_gsm8k_rl_models: 0.18\n798\t    gamma_gsm8k_rl_ci:\n799\t    - -0.15\n800\t    - 0.51\n801\t    gamma_arc_rl_models: 0.05\n802\t    gamma_arc_rl_ci:\n803\t    - -0.3\n804\t    - 0.4\n805\t    avg_ci_width_rl_pp: 15.5\n806\t    gamma_clean_benchmark_mean: 0.02\n807\t    gamma_clean_benchmark_ci:\n808\t    - -0.2\n809\t    - 0.24\n810\t    specificity_test_pass: true\n811\t    regret_uncalibrated_pp: 2.8\n812\t    regret_calibrated_pp: 2.3\n813\t    regret_delta_pp: 0.5\n814\t    n_observational_models: 10\n815\t  result_rationale: 'Observational study 的核心限制：无法使用 S1 (Embedding) 因为 Qwen2.5-Instruct\n816\t    和 DeepSeek-R1 的 exact training data 不可得。剩余 S2/S3/S4 在 controlled experiments 中\n817\t    AUC~0.50，因此 exposure estimates 本质上是 noise。IRT model 在 noisy exposure input 下的\n818\t    γ 后验接近先验（data 提供的 information 极少）， CI 极宽 (15.5pp)。γ 的 point estimates 微正（0.05-0.18）可能反映\n819\t    true contamination 也可能是 noise——CI 全部包含 0。Near-zero γ check 的 specificity test\n820\t    通过：在已知 clean benchmark (LiveBench subset) 上 γ≈0.02，CI 包含 0。 这证明 pipeline 不会 hallucinate\n821\t    contamination where none exists。但 sensitivity 太低：即使存在 moderate contamination，pipeline\n822\t    也无法检出（因为 signals 是 noise）。Expected regret 改善微弱 (0.5pp)：calibrated top-5 selection\n823\t    与 uncalibrated 几乎相同因为校准本身是 noisy。价值在于 CIs 的 honest width 传达了 epistemic uncertainty——用户知道这些模型的\n824\t    calibration 不可靠。\n825\t\n826\t    '\n827\t  tables:\n828\t  - name: 'Table: RL Observational Model Calibrated Scores'\n829\t    data:\n830\t      headers:\n831\t      - model\n832\t      - benchmark\n833\t      - raw_score\n834\t      - calibrated_mean\n835\t      - 95% CI\n836\t      - CI_width\n837\t      rows:\n838\t      - - Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct\n839\t        - MMLU\n840\t        - 0.445\n841\t        - 0.438\n842\t        - '[0.35, 0.53]'\n843\t        - 18.0\n844\t      - - Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct\n845\t        - MMLU\n846\t        - 0.605\n847\t        - 0.598\n848\t        - '[0.52, 0.68]'\n849\t        - 16.0\n850\t      - - Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\n851\t        - MMLU\n852\t        - 0.658\n853\t        - 0.652\n854\t        - '[0.58, 0.72]'\n855\t        - 14.0\n856\t      - - Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n857\t        - MMLU\n858\t        - 0.742\n859\t        - 0.735\n860\t        - '[0.67, 0.80]'\n861\t        - 13.0\n862\t      - - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B\n863\t        - MMLU\n864\t        - 0.55\n865\t        - 0.543\n866\t        - '[0.46, 0.63]'\n867\t        - 17.0\n868\t      - - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B\n869\t        - MMLU\n870\t        - 0.71\n871\t        - 0.704\n872\t        - '[0.63, 0.78]'\n873\t        - 15.0\n874\t  - name: 'Table: Expected Regret (Top-5 Selection)'\n875\t    data:\n876\t      headers:\n877\t      - strategy\n878\t      - avg_score_of_top5\n879\t      - regret_vs_oracle_pp\n880\t      rows:\n881\t      - - Uncalibrated\n882\t        - 0.685\n883\t        - 2.8\n884\t      - - Calibrated\n885\t        - 0.69\n886\t        - 2.3\n887\t      - - Remove-rescore\n888\t        - 0.682\n889\t        - 3.1\n890\t  figures_description:\n891\t  - 'RL model scores with wide CIs: forest plot of calibrated scores with error bars。CIs\n892\t    almost all overlap → \"we cannot distinguish contaminated from clean in observational\n893\t    setting\" 的 visual message。\n894\t\n895\t    '\n896\t  analysis: 'exp-009 delivers exactly the median-tier outcome：directional external\n897\t    validity only, not quantitative validation。Without S1 access, the pipeline loses\n898\t    its only effective signal。This is the most important structural limitation of\n899\t    ContamCal for practical deployment：it requires training data access (or at minimum,\n900\t    a high-quality contamination reference corpus) for the embedding signal。Paper\n901\t    应 frame this as：\"In the controlled setting (training data known), ContamCal provides\n902\t    meaningful calibration with moderate UQ。In the observational setting (training\n903\t    data unknown), it provides honest uncertainty bounds that correctly convey the\n904\t    epistemic limitation。\" The near-zero γ specificity check is a genuinely useful\n905\t    result：it demonstrates the framework doesn''t over-calibrate clean data。Expected\n906\t    regret improvement of 0.5pp is not statistically significant but directionally\n907\t    correct。建议 paper 将 exp-009 作为 \"Application Case Study\" 而非 core validation，强调 CIs\n908\t    的 informational value over point estimates。\n909\t\n910\t    '\n911\t- name: observational_72b\n912\t  plan_id: exp-012\n913\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-72B observational analysis。Inference only (no SFT)。 Extends\n914\t    ecological validity to frontier model scale。\n915\t\n916\t    '\n917\t  expected_results:\n918\t    eval_72B_mmlu: 0.858\n919\t    eval_72B_gsm8k: 0.912\n920\t    eval_72B_arc: 0.955\n921\t    S2_72B_mmlu_auc: N/A (no contamination labels)\n922\t    S2_72B_minkpp_mean_score: 1.85\n923\t    S4_72B_selfcritique_entropy_mean: -0.82\n924\t    calibrated_72B_mmlu: 0.852\n925\t    calibrated_72B_mmlu_ci:\n926\t    - 0.78\n927\t    - 0.92\n928\t    calibrated_72B_gsm8k: 0.905\n929\t    calibrated_72B_gsm8k_ci:\n930\t    - 0.83\n931\t    - 0.97\n932\t    calibrated_72B_arc: 0.951\n933\t    calibrated_72B_arc_ci:\n934\t    - 0.89\n935\t    - 1.0\n936\t    avg_ci_width_pp: 12.8\n937\t    inference_time_hours: 8\n938\t  result_rationale: '72B 是 frontier-scale 生态效度测试。与 exp-009 相同的 fundamental limitation：\n939\t    无 training data access → 无 S1 → exposure estimates 基于 S2/S4 (noise)。 Calibrated\n940\t    scores 仅微降 (0.5-0.7pp)，CIs 宽 (~13pp)——framework 诚实地传达 \"we don''t know whether\n941\t    this model is contaminated or not\"。72B 的 near-ceiling scores (MMLU 0.858, ARC\n942\t    0.955) 使得 calibration 空间本身有限：即使存在 contamination，最大 inflation 也受 ceiling 约束。主要价值：(1)\n943\t    证明 pipeline 可以 handle frontier-scale 模型的 inference cost；(2) 在 paper 中 report 72B\n944\t    results 增加 reviewer confidence（\"they tested on big models too\"）；(3) 宽 CIs 示范了\n945\t    uncertainty-aware evaluation 的价值。\n946\t\n947\t    '\n948\t  tables:\n949\t  - name: 'Table: 72B Observational Calibration'\n950\t    data:\n951\t      headers:\n952\t      - benchmark\n953\t      - raw\n954\t      - calibrated\n955\t      - 95% CI\n956\t      - CI width (pp)\n957\t      rows:\n958\t      - - MMLU\n959\t        - 0.858\n960\t        - 0.852\n961\t        - '[0.78, 0.92]'\n962\t        - 14.0\n963\t      - - GSM8K\n964\t        - 0.912\n965\t        - 0.905\n966\t        - '[0.83, 0.97]'\n967\t        - 14.0\n968\t      - - ARC\n969\t        - 0.955\n970\t        - 0.951\n971\t        - '[0.89, 1.00]'\n972\t        - 11.0\n973\t  figures_description:\n974\t  - '扩展 Fig 5 (scatter plot)：增加 72B 点 with 巨大 error bars，突出与 controlled models (tight\n975\t    CIs) 的对比。\n976\t\n977\t    '\n978\t  analysis: '72B observational 的加入提升了 paper 的 model coverage story (0.5B→72B) 但不提供\n979\t    quantitative validation。建议 paper 在 one paragraph 中 report 72B results，作为 \"scaling\n980\t    demonstration\" 而非 evidence for calibration accuracy。关键 takeaway：ContamCal at 72B\n981\t    = wide CIs indicating genuine epistemic uncertainty about contamination status，which\n982\t    is the correct scientific answer when we lack sufficient signal quality。\n983\t\n984\t    '\n985\t- name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n986\t  plan_id: exp-013\n987\t  description: 'Degraded 2-signal mode (ConStat + Self-Critique only, no logits/embeddings)\n988\t    模拟 closed-weight API-only models 的场景。\n989\t\n990\t    '\n991\t  expected_results:\n992\t    rrf_2signal_auc_05B: 0.51\n993\t    rrf_2signal_auc_15B: 0.53\n994\t    rrf_2signal_auc_3B: 0.548\n995\t    rrf_2signal_auc_mean: 0.529\n996\t    MAE_2signal_4pl_gamma: 6.7\n997\t    MAE_2signal_4pl_gamma_ci:\n998\t    - 5.0\n999\t    - 8.4\n1000\t    CI_coverage_95_2signal: 0.7\n1001\t    CI_width_avg_2signal_pp: 12.5\n1002\t    MAE_gap_vs_4signal_pp: 2.4\n1003\t    coverage_gap_vs_4signal: 0.15\n1004\t    kendall_tau_2signal: 0.8\n1005\t  result_rationale: '2-signal mode (S3+S4) 的 RRF AUC 0.53 意味着 exposure scores 几乎是\n1006\t    random noise。IRT model 在 random exposure input 下：γ posterior 被 prior dominated\n1007\t    (data 无 information)，calibrated scores ≈ vanilla IRT 预测（no contamination correction）。MAE\n1008\t    6.7pp 仅略优于 vanilla 4PL 的 6.0pp——improvement 可能来自 S3/S4 的残余微弱 signal (AUC 0.53\n1009\t    不完全是 0.50) 但 statistically insignificant。 Coverage 0.70 低于 4-signal 的 0.85 因为\n1010\t    measurement error 更大但 ME model 无法正确估计 noise level (σ_e calibration 来自 controlled\n1011\t    experiments where S1 was available)。CI width 12.5pp 虽然 wider 但不够 wide to compensate\n1012\t    for near-random exposure。Kendall tau 0.80 接近 Raw 0.82——calibration 未破坏 ranking\n1013\t    但也未改善。\n1014\t\n1015\t    '\n1016\t  tables:\n1017\t  - name: 'Table: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal Calibration Comparison'\n1018\t    data:\n1019\t      headers:\n1020\t      - metric\n1021\t      - 4-signal (S1-dom)\n1022\t      - 2-signal (S3+S4)\n1023\t      - gap\n1024\t      rows:\n1025\t      - - MAE (pp)\n1026\t        - 4.3\n1027\t        - 6.7\n1028\t        - 2.4\n1029\t      - - 95% Coverage\n1030\t        - 0.85\n1031\t        - 0.7\n1032\t        - -0.15\n1033\t      - - CI Width (pp)\n1034\t        - 8.5\n1035\t        - 12.5\n1036\t        - 4.0\n1037\t      - - Kendall τ\n1038\t        - 0.85\n1039\t        - 0.8\n1040\t        - -0.05\n1041\t      - - Exposure AUC\n1042\t        - 0.947\n1043\t        - 0.529\n1044\t        - -0.418\n1045\t  figures_description:\n1046\t  - 'Paired comparison: 4-signal vs 2-signal calibrated scores for same models。 4-signal\n1047\t    版本 tight CIs close to diagonal; 2-signal 版本 wide CIs, points scattered。Visual\n1048\t    demonstration of information loss。\n1049\t\n1050\t    '\n1051\t  analysis: 'exp-013 quantifies the cost of closed-weight constraint: 2.4pp MAE degradation\n1052\t    and 15pp coverage drop。Practical implication：ContamCal is NOT viable for closed-weight\n1053\t    models (GPT-4, Claude, Gemini) in current form。This is a fundamental limitation,\n1054\t    not a fixable gap。Paper 应 frame this as honest scoping：\"ContamCal requires model\n1055\t    logit/embedding access for effective calibration。For closed-weight models, the\n1056\t    framework provides only uncertainty bounds (wide CIs) without meaningful point\n1057\t    estimate correction。\" Potential future work: stronger closed-weight signals (e.g.,\n1058\t    output distribution analysis, benchmark-specific probing) could close this gap。\n1059\t\n1060\t    '\n1061\t- name: multi_family_validation\n1062\t  plan_id: exp-014\n1063\t  description: 'Controlled SFT injection on non-Qwen model (Llama-3.2-1B) at 3 dosage\n1064\t    levels。 Rebuttal-ready validation of cross-family generalization。\n1065\t\n1066\t    '\n1067\t  expected_results:\n1068\t    eval_llama1B_d000_mmlu: 0.432\n1069\t    eval_llama1B_d000_gsm8k: 0.285\n1070\t    eval_llama1B_d000_arc: 0.52\n1071\t    eval_llama1B_d025_mmlu: 0.385\n1072\t    eval_llama1B_d025_gsm8k: 0.28\n1073\t    eval_llama1B_d025_arc: 0.445\n1074\t    eval_llama1B_d100_mmlu: 0.345\n1075\t    eval_llama1B_d100_gsm8k: 0.275\n1076\t    eval_llama1B_d100_arc: 0.395\n1077\t    contamination_effect_pattern: regression (same as Qwen 0.5B)\n1078\t    mmlu_d100_delta_pp: -8.7\n1079\t    arc_d100_delta_pp: -12.5\n1080\t    gsm8k_d100_delta_pp: -1.0\n1081\t    S1_d005_llama_auc: 0.968\n1082\t    S2_d005_llama_auc: 0.478\n1083\t    S4_d005_llama_auc: 0.495\n1084\t    S2_d100_llama_cohens_d: -1.55\n1085\t    calibration_MAE_llama_4pl: 5.8\n1086\t    calibration_MAE_llama_4pl_ci:\n1087\t    - 3.8\n1088\t    - 7.8\n1089\t    signal_pattern_matches_qwen: true\n1090\t    regression_pattern_matches_qwen_05B: true\n1091\t    sft_llama_time_per_run_hours: 2.5\n1092\t    sft_llama_gpu_budget_hours: 8\n1093\t  result_rationale: 'Llama-3.2-1B (1.24B params) 与 Qwen2.5-0.5B 规模相近，预期展现相同的 contamination\n1094\t    regression pattern：小模型无法从 memorization 获益，contaminated SFT 反而 disrupts general\n1095\t    ability。MMLU -8.7pp 和 ARC -12.5pp 的 regression 幅度与 Qwen 0.5B (-11.8pp / -14.4pp\n1096\t    at d025) 量级一致，但具体数值不同（different architecture, tokenizer, training dynamics）。GSM8K\n1097\t    变化微小 (-1.0pp) 因为 Llama-1B 的 GSM8K baseline (28.5%) 没有 catastrophic forgetting\n1098\t    问题。Signal effectiveness 完美复现 Qwen pattern：S1 高 (0.968)，S2/S4 chance level， Min-K++\n1099\t    方向反转。S1 的 cross-family consistency (Qwen 0.979, Llama 0.968) confirms embedding\n1100\t    signal 是 truly model-agnostic。Calibration MAE 5.8pp 略高于 Qwen average (4.3pp) 因为只有\n1101\t    3 dosage levels（fewer data points for γ estimation） 且 only 1 scale（no multi-scale\n1102\t    information to help identify γ）。Bootstrap CI [3.8, 7.8] 与 Qwen CI [3.1, 5.5] 部分重叠，无法\n1103\t    reject 两者的 calibration accuracy 相同。关键 rebuttal message：\"method and signal patterns\n1104\t    generalize across model families; single-family limitation acknowledged but does\n1105\t    not invalidate core findings。\"\n1106\t\n1107\t    '\n1108\t  tables:\n1109\t  - name: 'Table: Cross-Family Signal Comparison'\n1110\t    data:\n1111\t      headers:\n1112\t      - signal\n1113\t      - Qwen 0.5B AUC\n1114\t      - Llama 1B AUC\n1115\t      - Consistent?\n1116\t      rows:\n1117\t      - - S1 Embedding\n1118\t        - 0.979\n1119\t        - 0.968\n1120\t        - Yes (Δ=0.011)\n1121\t      - - S2 Min-K++\n1122\t        - 0.465\n1123\t        - 0.478\n1124\t        - Yes (both chance)\n1125\t      - - S4 Self-Critique\n1126\t        - 0.481\n1127\t        - 0.495\n1128\t        - Yes (both chance)\n1129\t      - - S2 reversal (d)\n1130\t        - -1.98\n1131\t        - -1.55\n1132\t        - Yes (both negative)\n1133\t  - name: 'Table: Cross-Family Calibration Comparison'\n1134\t    data:\n1135\t      headers:\n1136\t      - metric\n1137\t      - Qwen_all_scales\n1138\t      - Llama_1B\n1139\t      - consistent\n1140\t      rows:\n1141\t      - - MAE (pp)\n1142\t        - 4.3 [3.1, 5.5]\n1143\t        - 5.8 [3.8, 7.8]\n1144\t        - CIs overlap\n1145\t      - - 95% Coverage\n1146\t        - 0.85\n1147\t        - 0.8\n1148\t        - Within range\n1149\t      - - γ_MMLU\n1150\t        - 0.12 [-0.03, 0.27]\n1151\t        - 0.10 [-0.10, 0.30]\n1152\t        - CIs overlap\n1153\t  figures_description:\n1154\t  - 'Cross-family signal pattern comparison: paired bar chart of AUC values for Qwen\n1155\t    vs Llama per signal。Pattern identical (S1 high, S2/S4 low) regardless of family。\n1156\t\n1157\t    '\n1158\t  analysis: 'exp-014 confirms cross-family generalization at the pattern level: signal\n1159\t    effectiveness, contamination regression at small scale, and Min-K++ reversal all\n1160\t    replicate。Quantitative calibration accuracy is comparable (overlapping CIs) but\n1161\t    less precise due to fewer conditions。For rebuttal strategy：if reviewer asks \"why\n1162\t    only Qwen?\", response is \"(1) Qwen provides controlled multi-scale setup with\n1163\t    consistent tokenizer/architecture; (2) Llama replication confirms patterns generalize;\n1164\t    (3) full multi-family, multi-scale validation is scientifically valuable but exceeds\n1165\t    single-paper scope — provided as rebuttal evidence。\" The Llama results also independently\n1166\t    validate the small-model regression finding: contamination SFT hurts ~1B models\n1167\t    across architectures, not just Qwen。This is a second novel empirical finding (alongside\n1168\t    Min-K++ reversal) that the detection community should know about。'\n1169\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d1bd2efb-8d16-4e43-8307-de39852ed51a","uuid":"e5d39eb1-4741-41c8-abde-900daf234e65","timestamp":"2026-05-14T18:29:22.381Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T171536/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'C1 保留但降低 claim 强度：ContamCal provides statistically grounded calibration\n  with UQ, outperforming naive/mitigation-based approaches on point estimates, but\n  advantage over linear regression and single-signal 2PL is marginal (overlapping\n  95% bootstrap CIs). UQ 是独特贡献——其他 baselines 无 credible intervals，coverage ~0.85 虽未达\n  nominal 0.95 但远优于 bootstrap CI (~0.72)。C2 完全降级为 method-specific signal failure modes：\n  S2/S4 在 1.5B/3B 仍无效（AUC<0.60），''scale-dependent'' 不可验证；Min-K++ 方向性反转 在所有 scale 持续存在（Cohen''s\n  d -1.0 to -2.7），这是核心 empirical finding。RRF fusion 在所有 scale 退化为 S1-dominated mode（RRF-4\n  AUC ≈ S1 AUC - 0.01-0.02）， 讨论移入 Limitations 但保留 meta-circularity argument。C3 identifiability\n  threshold 上调至 AUC≥0.80：simulation 在 AUC=0.55 仍可 recover γ（bias<0.02），但 real data\n  的 local independence violation + heterogeneous contamination effects 使得实际 threshold\n  更高。关键补充讨论：(1) 0.5B contamination regression——SFT 注入污染数据导致小模型能力 退化 7-15pp，IRT 无法修复因为\n  θ degradation 不可逆；(2) 3B GSM8K format confound—— d000→d100 的 58pp 跳升主要是 SFT 教会模型\n  GSM8K 答题格式而非纯 contamination memorization；(3) Coverage gap (0.85 vs 0.95 nominal)\n  归因于 local independence violation + single-γ per benchmark 无法捕获 scale-specific effects。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: '在 exp-001 产出的全部 contaminated + clean 模型上计算 4 个 detection signals。\n    0.5B 数据已有（exp_002_signals_05B），此处扩展至 1.5B 和 3B。关键问题：S2/S4 在更大 scale 是否恢复有效性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    S1_d005_15B_mmlu_auc: 0.961\n    S1_d005_15B_gsm8k_auc: 0.978\n    S1_d005_15B_arc_auc: 0.99\n    S2_d005_15B_mmlu_auc: 0.502\n    S2_d005_15B_gsm8k_auc: 0.489\n    S2_d005_15B_arc_auc: 0.515\n    S3_d005_15B_mmlu_auc: 0.535\n    S3_d005_15B_gsm8k_auc: 0.52\n    S3_d005_15B_arc_auc: 0.548\n    S4_d005_15B_mmlu_auc: 0.523\n    S4_d005_15B_gsm8k_auc: 0.508\n    S4_d005_15B_arc_auc: 0.537\n    S1_d005_3B_mmlu_auc: 0.955\n    S1_d005_3B_gsm8k_auc: 0.972\n    S1_d005_3B_arc_auc: 0.986\n    S2_d005_3B_mmlu_auc: 0.538\n    S2_d005_3B_gsm8k_auc: 0.512\n    S2_d005_3B_arc_auc: 0.552\n    S3_d005_3B_mmlu_auc: 0.558\n    S3_d005_3B_gsm8k_auc: 0.543\n    S3_d005_3B_arc_auc: 0.578\n    S4_d005_3B_mmlu_auc: 0.542\n    S4_d005_3B_gsm8k_auc: 0.525\n    S4_d005_3B_arc_auc: 0.558\n    S1_d100_15B_cohens_d_mean: 3.15\n    S2_d100_15B_cohens_d_mean: -1.45\n    S4_d100_15B_cohens_d_mean: 0.38\n    S1_d100_3B_cohens_d_mean: 3.52\n    S2_d100_3B_cohens_d_mean: -1.63\n    S4_d100_3B_cohens_d_mean: 0.52\n    S1_d005_multiscale_auc_mean: 0.974\n    S2_d005_multiscale_auc_mean: 0.5\n    S4_d005_multiscale_auc_mean: 0.514\n    effective_signals_all_scales: 1\n    computation_time_hours: 16\n  result_rationale: 'S1 (Embedding) 是外部模型 (sentence-transformers) 计算的语义相似度，不依赖 target\n    model 的内部表示，因此 scale-invariant——0.5B/1.5B/3B 的 AUC 稳定在 0.95-0.99。S2 (Min-K++)\n    依赖 target model 的 token-level perplexity 来区分 seen vs unseen items，但 LoRA SFT 仅修改\n    ~1% 参数，对 perplexity 分布影响极微； 加之 paraphrase 改变了 surface form，Min-K++ 无法通过精确 token\n    匹配检测。1.5B/3B 的 S2 AUC 微升至 0.50-0.55（更大模型 perplexity 分布稍更尖锐），但远未达有效 阈值（0.70+）。S4\n    (Self-Critique) 要求模型内省判断哪些 items 被\"记住\"，0.5B-3B 模型的元认知能力不足以可靠区分 contaminated vs\n    clean items。S3 (ConStat) 依赖 原题 vs 改写题的得分差异，但 1.5B/3B 的 contamination inflation\n    极小（<2pp）， ConStat 检测不到显著 gap。Min-K++ 方向性反转在 1.5B/3B 持续存在：高污染下模型 对 contaminated\n    items 的 Min-K++ score 反而更低（LoRA adaptation 降低了这些 items 的 surprise），导致 signal 指向错误方向。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Signal × Scale AUC Heatmap (d005, within-model)'\n    data:\n      headers:\n      - signal\n      - 0.5B_mmlu\n      - 0.5B_gsm8k\n      - 0.5B_arc\n      - 1.5B_mmlu\n      - 1.5B_gsm8k\n      - 1.5B_arc\n      - 3B_mmlu\n      - 3B_gsm8k\n      - 3B_arc\n      rows:\n      - - S1_Embedding\n        - 0.953\n        - 0.988\n        - 0.995\n        - 0.961\n        - 0.978\n        - 0.99\n        - 0.955\n        - 0.972\n        - 0.986\n      - - S2_MinKPP\n        - 0.466\n        - 0.465\n        - 0.466\n        - 0.502\n        - 0.489\n        - 0.515\n        - 0.538\n        - 0.512\n        - 0.552\n      - - S3_ConStat\n        - 0.52\n        - 0.51\n        - 0.54\n        - 0.535\n        - 0.52\n        - 0.548\n        - 0.558\n        - 0.543\n        - 0.578\n      - - S4_SelfCritique\n        - 0.517\n        - 0.495\n        - 0.433\n        - 0.523\n        - 0.508\n        - 0.537\n        - 0.542\n        - 0.525\n        - 0.558\n  - name: 'Table: Min-K++ Directional Reversal (d100 cross-model Cohen''s d)'\n    data:\n      headers:\n      - scale\n      - mmlu\n      - gsm8k\n      - arc\n      - mean\n      rows:\n      - - 0.5B\n        - -1.22\n        - -2.67\n        - -2.05\n        - -1.98\n      - - 1.5B\n        - -1.05\n        - -1.82\n        - -1.48\n        - -1.45\n      - - 3B\n        - -1.15\n        - -2.1\n        - -1.65\n        - -1.63\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Signal × Scale × Benchmark AUC heatmap (3 signals × 3 scales × 3 benchmarks)。\n    颜色编码 AUC：深绿 (>0.90) 仅出现在 S1 行，其余行全部浅红/灰 (<0.60)。 视觉上立即传达 \"only embedding works\"\n    的核心信息。\n\n    '\n  - 'Min-K++ d100 cross-model effect size 柱状图：3 scales × 3 benchmarks， 所有柱子向下延伸（负值），颜色由\n    scale 区分。Caption 强调方向性反转。\n\n    '\n  analysis: '核心发现确认：S2/S4 在 1.5B/3B 未恢复有效性，''scale-dependent'' claim 无法支撑， 必须降级为 ''method-specific''。S2\n    从 0.5B 的 0.465 微升至 3B 的 0.531，统计上 仍为 chance level。S4 类似（0.481→0.542）。S3 (ConStat)\n    也始终低于 0.60， 因为 contamination 对 1.5B/3B 的 overall accuracy 影响极小 (<2pp)，原题 vs 改写题的\n    performance gap 淹没在 noise 中。Min-K++ 方向性反转在所有 scale 持续， Cohen''s d 从 0.5B 的 -1.98\n    变为 3B 的 -1.63——反转幅度随 scale 略减但始终显著 (p<0.001)。这意味着使用 Min-K++ 作为 contamination signal\n    不仅无效，而且会 actively mislead——将 contaminated items 标记为 clean。此 finding 对 detection\n    community 有独立价值。S1 的 scale-invariance (AUC 0.95-0.99) 的理论解释： embedding similarity\n    由 external sentence-transformer 计算，与 target model 的 training 无关，因此不受 scale/regime\n    影响。\n\n    '\n- name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: 'RRF fusion 及 ablations。0.5B RRF 已完成 (exp_003_rrf_05B)，此处扩展至 全 scale\n    并完成完整 ablation matrix。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    rrf_4signal_d005_05B_auc: 0.944\n    rrf_4signal_d005_15B_auc: 0.95\n    rrf_4signal_d005_3B_auc: 0.948\n    s1_only_d005_05B_auc: 0.979\n    s1_only_d005_15B_auc: 0.976\n    s1_only_d005_3B_auc: 0.971\n    s2_only_d005_auc_mean: 0.5\n    s3_only_d005_auc_mean: 0.537\n    s4_only_d005_auc_mean: 0.514\n    equal_weight_rank_avg_d005_auc: 0.938\n    calibration_weighted_rrf_d005_auc: 0.96\n    rrf_2signal_d005_auc: 0.53\n    rrf4_vs_s1_spearman: 0.962\n    rrf_fp_1x_auc: 0.928\n    rrf_fp_2x_auc: 0.895\n    rrf4_vs_s1_delta_auc: -0.03\n  result_rationale: 'RRF 将 4 signals 的排名通过 1/(k+rank) 融合。当 S2/S3/S4 为 random（AUC~0.50），\n    它们对每个 item 贡献相近的 RRF 分数（均匀分布在 rank 空间），相当于添加 constant + noise。S1 的 discriminative\n    ranking 占据主导。具体：contaminated item 的 S1 rank 极低（e.g., top 5%），贡献 1/(60+rank) ≈\n    0.016，远大于 random signals 的 贡献（~0.0001）。因此 RRF-4 的 exposure ranking 与 S1-only 的\n    Spearman 相关达 0.96，RRF-4 AUC 仅比 S1 低 0.02-0.03（random signals 的 noise 引入微量 rank\n    扰动）。Calibration-weighted RRF 通过降低 S2/S3/S4 权重接近 S1-only（AUC 0.96 vs 0.979），但仍不如直接用\n    S1。Equal-weight rank averaging 效果略差于 RRF 因为 RRF 的 1/(k+rank) 形式天然上调 top-ranked\n    items 的 influence。2-signal closed-weight mode (S3+S4) 的 AUC 0.53 几乎等于 chance——两个\n    random signals 的 fusion 仍然 random。FP injection 降低了 S1 的 precision，连带拉低 RRF：1×\n    FP 使 AUC 降至 0.928，2× 降至 0.895，但仍远优于其他 signals。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Aggregation Method Comparison (d005 AUC)'\n    data:\n      headers:\n      - method\n      - 0.5B\n      - 1.5B\n      - 3B\n      - mean\n      rows:\n      - - S1-only\n        - 0.979\n        - 0.976\n        - 0.971\n        - 0.975\n      - - RRF-4 (all signals)\n        - 0.944\n        - 0.95\n        - 0.948\n        - 0.947\n      - - Calibration-weighted RRF\n        - 0.958\n        - 0.962\n        - 0.96\n        - 0.96\n      - - Equal-weight averaging\n        - 0.935\n        - 0.94\n        - 0.938\n        - 0.938\n      - - S2-only (Min-K++)\n        - 0.465\n        - 0.502\n        - 0.531\n        - 0.499\n      - - S3-only (ConStat)\n        - 0.523\n        - 0.534\n        - 0.56\n        - 0.539\n      - - S4-only (Self-Critique)\n        - 0.481\n        - 0.523\n        - 0.542\n        - 0.515\n      - - RRF-2 (S3+S4)\n        - 0.51\n        - 0.53\n        - 0.548\n        - 0.529\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Ablation 柱状图：各 aggregation method 的 AUC，按 scale 分组。S1-only 柱子 最高，RRF-4 紧随，其余远低。标注\n    RRF-4 vs S1 的 delta。\n\n    '\n  - 'Exposure score scatter: RRF-4 vs S1-only per-item scores，Spearman ρ=0.96 标注在图上。几乎在\n    y=x 线上，说明 RRF ≈ S1。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'RRF 在 \"all constituent signals work\" 前提下是 principled 的 aggregation choice，\n    但当 3/4 signals 为 random 时退化为 S1-dominated mode。实质贡献为零：使用 RRF-4 反而比 S1-only 损失\n    ~3pp AUC。Calibration-weighted RRF (学习 signal weights) 能部分恢复，但需要 labeled data 来学\n    weights——引入 meta-circularity（用 potentially contaminated data 来学 contamination\n    detector 的 weights）。这正是 论文使用 training-free RRF 而非 learned aggregation 的理由。Closed-weight\n    2-signal mode (AUC 0.53) 对 API-only 模型几乎无用——paper 应诚实报告此为 fundamental limitation\n    而非 \"degraded mode\"。RRF 的 FP robustness 检查表明即使 注入 2× FP，AUC 仍>0.89，因为 RRF 的 rank-based\n    形式天然对 outlier scores 有 robustness。Paper 推荐：在 Method section 保留 RRF 作为 default\n    aggregation （principled + robust），但在 Results 显示 S1-only 与 RRF-4 无显著差异，将 RRF vs\n    S1 的 non-improvement 移入 Limitations 并保留 meta-circularity defense。\n\n    '\n- name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: '核心实验。在 exp-001/003 产出上 fit 4PL+γ IRT，比较 7 baselines。 Per-benchmark\n    fitting (γ_k) 为 primary；joint fitting (global γ) 为 ablation。 含 measurement error\n    model (from exp-005) 的 coverage 对比。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    calibration_MAE_pp_4pl_gamma: 4.3\n    calibration_MAE_pp_4pl_gamma_bootstrap_ci:\n    - 3.1\n    - 5.5\n    calibration_MAE_pp_linear_reg: 4.8\n    calibration_MAE_pp_linear_reg_ci:\n    - 3.5\n    - 6.1\n    calibration_MAE_pp_single_2pl_gamma: 4.6\n    calibration_MAE_pp_single_2pl_gamma_ci:\n    - 3.3\n    - 5.9\n    calibration_MAE_pp_remove_rescore: 5.5\n    calibration_MAE_pp_dcr: 5.2\n    calibration_MAE_pp_vanilla_4pl: 6.0\n    calibration_MAE_pp_emperor_rephrase: 6.5\n    calibration_MAE_pp_emperor_shuffle: 6.8\n    calibration_MAE_pp_raw: 7.2\n    mae_4pl_mmlu_pp: 3.8\n    mae_4pl_gsm8k_pp: 5.2\n    mae_4pl_arc_pp: 4.0\n    mae_4pl_humaneval_pp: 7.5\n    mae_raw_mmlu_pp: 4.2\n    mae_raw_gsm8k_pp: 12.8\n    mae_raw_arc_pp: 5.5\n    CI_coverage_95_with_ME: 0.85\n    CI_coverage_80_with_ME: 0.73\n    CI_coverage_50_with_ME: 0.46\n    CI_coverage_95_without_ME: 0.77\n    CI_coverage_80_without_ME: 0.65\n    CI_coverage_50_without_ME: 0.4\n    CI_coverage_95_linear_reg: 0.72\n    CI_width_avg_pp_with_ME: 8.5\n    CI_width_avg_pp_without_ME: 6.8\n    CI_width_avg_pp_linear_reg: 5.2\n    kendall_tau_4pl_gamma: 0.85\n    kendall_tau_raw: 0.82\n    kendall_tau_linear_reg: 0.84\n    dose_response_monotonicity_mmlu: 0.83\n    dose_response_monotonicity_gsm8k: 0.68\n    dose_response_monotonicity_arc: 0.78\n    dose_response_monotonicity_avg: 0.76\n    gamma_mmlu_mean: 0.12\n    gamma_mmlu_ci:\n    - -0.03\n    - 0.27\n    gamma_gsm8k_mean: 1.85\n    gamma_gsm8k_ci:\n    - 0.9\n    - 2.8\n    gamma_arc_mean: 0.08\n    gamma_arc_ci:\n    - -0.08\n    - 0.24\n    gamma_humaneval_mean: 0.15\n    gamma_humaneval_ci:\n    - -0.2\n    - 0.5\n    global_gamma_mean: 0.35\n    global_gamma_ci:\n    - 0.15\n    - 0.55\n    global_gamma_MAE_pp: 5.8\n    max_rhat: 1.008\n    min_ess_bulk: 800\n    divergent_pct: 0.2\n    mean_residual_item_correlation: 0.08\n    residual_correlation_95th_pct: 0.15\n  result_rationale: '4PL+γ 的 overall MAE (4.3pp) 主要由三个 regime 驱动：(1) 0.5B regression\n    regime — contamination SFT 导致小模型能力退化 7-15pp (MMLU) / 14-17pp (ARC)，IRT 正确 识别 contaminated\n    items 的 γ boost 但无法修复 θ degradation，counterfactual prediction 反映 degraded θ，MAE\n    ≈ Raw MAE (~10-13pp)。这是 fundamental limitation： IRT 校准的是 \"如果没看过 test items 成绩会怎样\"，但\n    θ 本身已被 contaminated SFT irreversibly 改变。(2) 1.5B/3B MMLU/ARC regime — contamination\n    inflation 极小 (<2pp)，所有 methods 的 MAE 都低 (<1pp)，4PL+γ 无显著优势。(3) 3B GSM8K format\n    confound regime — d000→d100 跳升 58pp，但主因是 clean SFT 导致 GSM8K catastrophic forgetting\n    (base 60.5%→SFT 12%)，contamination SFT 恢复格式能力。 γ_GSM8K 估计值 1.85 (logit scale)\n    巨大，counterfactual 大幅下调 d100 预测至 ~12-15%，接近 d000 ground truth (12%)。这是 4PL+γ 的最大\n    MAE 改进来源（Raw MAE 33pp → 4PL+γ MAE ~5pp on 3B GSM8K）。但 intermediate dosages (d005/d025)\n    存在 format spillover：即使少量 contamination items 也部分教会 format，使 unexposed items accuracy\n    上升→ θ 被高估→ counterfactual over-predicts。MAE 4.3pp vs linear reg 4.8pp 和 single-2PL\n    4.6pp 的差异落在 bootstrap CI 重叠区间内，因为 所有三种方法都 capture 了 GSM8K 的主要 exposure-accuracy\n    关系，差异仅来自 IRT 的更灵活 item modeling (c, d parameters)。Coverage 0.85 (with ME) vs nominal\n    0.95 的 gap 来自两个来源：(a) local independence violation — 单模型的所有 item responses 通过\n    shared parameters 相关，standard IRT 假设 independence 导致 CIs 系统性偏窄； (b) single γ per\n    benchmark 无法捕获 scale-specific contamination effects（0.5B 的负效应 vs 3B 的正效应被同一个 γ\n    平均）。Measurement error model 通过 widening CIs ~25% (6.8pp→8.5pp) 将 coverage 从 0.77\n    提升至 0.85，但 widening 是 uniform 的——理想情况应 scale-dependent (高 AUC models 的 CI 更窄)。Kendall\n    τ = 0.85 对比 Raw 0.82 因为 GSM8K 的 large contamination effect 在 3B 会 swap 模型排名 （d100\n    3B GSM8K 70% vs d000 12%），calibration 修复了这个 swap。Dose-response monotonicity 在\n    MMLU (0.83) 和 ARC (0.78) 尚可，但 GSM8K (0.68) 偏低—— format learning 的非线性 dose-response（少量\n    contamination 已教会大部分 format） 使得 γ*exposure 的线性假设不成立。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3 (Main): Calibration MAE (pp) by Method and Benchmark'\n    data:\n      headers:\n      - method\n      - MMLU\n      - GSM8K\n      - ARC\n      - Average\n      - 95% CI\n      - has_UQ\n      rows:\n      - - 4PL+γ (ours)\n        - 3.8\n        - 5.2\n        - 4.0\n        - 4.3\n        - '[3.1, 5.5]'\n        - true\n      - - Single-signal 2PL+γ\n        - 3.9\n        - 5.5\n        - 4.3\n        - 4.6\n        - '[3.3, 5.9]'\n        - true\n      - - Linear reg + bootstrap\n        - 4.0\n        - 5.8\n        - 4.5\n        - 4.8\n        - '[3.5, 6.1]'\n        - true\n      - - DCR (EMNLP 2025)\n        - 4.0\n        - 6.5\n        - 5.0\n        - 5.2\n        - —\n        - false\n      - - Remove-and-rescore\n        - 4.2\n        - 7.0\n        - 5.2\n        - 5.5\n        - —\n        - false\n      - - Vanilla 4PL (no γ)\n        - 4.1\n        - 9.2\n        - 4.8\n        - 6.0\n        - —\n        - false\n      - - Emperor-rephrase\n        - 4.0\n        - 10.8\n        - 5.0\n        - 6.5\n        - —\n        - false\n      - - Emperor-shuffle\n        - 4.2\n        - 11.5\n        - 5.2\n        - 6.8\n        - —\n        - false\n      - - Raw (no adjustment)\n        - 4.2\n        - 12.8\n        - 5.5\n        - 7.2\n        - —\n        - false\n  - name: 'Table 4: Credible Interval Coverage and Sharpness'\n    data:\n      headers:\n      - method\n      - Cov@50%\n      - Cov@80%\n      - Cov@95%\n      - Width (pp)\n      rows:\n      - - 4PL+γ + ME model\n        - 0.46\n        - 0.73\n        - 0.85\n        - 8.5\n      - - 4PL+γ (point exposure)\n        - 0.4\n        - 0.65\n        - 0.77\n        - 6.8\n      - - Linear reg + bootstrap\n        - 0.35\n        - 0.58\n        - 0.72\n        - 5.2\n  - name: 'Table 5: Per-Benchmark γ_k Estimates'\n    data:\n      headers:\n      - benchmark\n      - γ_k (logit)\n      - 95% CI\n      - CI excludes 0?\n      - interpretation\n      rows:\n      - - MMLU\n        - 0.12\n        - '[-0.03, 0.27]'\n        - 'No'\n        - Marginal contamination effect\n      - - GSM8K\n        - 1.85\n        - '[0.90, 2.80]'\n        - 'Yes'\n        - Large — confounded by format learning\n      - - ARC\n        - 0.08\n        - '[-0.08, 0.24]'\n        - 'No'\n        - Negligible contamination effect\n      - - HumanEval\n        - 0.15\n        - '[-0.20, 0.50]'\n        - 'No'\n        - Unreliable (N=164, low QC)\n  - name: 'Table S1 (Appendix): Per-Scale MAE Breakdown for 4PL+γ (pp)'\n    data:\n      headers:\n      - scale\n      - MMLU\n      - GSM8K\n      - ARC\n      - note\n      rows:\n      - - 0.5B\n        - 10.2\n        - 0.8\n        - 12.5\n        - Dominated by SFT ability regression\n      - - 1.5B\n        - 0.6\n        - 0.5\n        - 0.4\n        - Minimal contamination effect\n      - - 3B\n        - 0.5\n        - 5.2\n        - 0.8\n        - 'GSM8K: format confound partially corrected'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 5: Calibrated-vs-true accuracy scatter (per-model per-benchmark dots) with\n    95% CIs as error bars。Perfect calibration = diagonal line。4PL+γ points cluster\n    near diagonal with CIs spanning it (coverage 0.85)。Highlight: 0.5B points systematically\n    below diagonal (under-prediction from θ regression)； 3B GSM8K d100 point dramatically\n    corrected from far off-diagonal (Raw) to near-diagonal (calibrated)。\n\n    '\n  - 'Fig 3: Dose-response curves — 3 panels (MMLU, GSM8K, ARC)。X-axis: dosage (0%→100%)。Y-axis:\n    accuracy。Each scale as separate line。Overlaid: 4PL+γ predicted counterfactual\n    (dashed horizontal line at θ level) with CI band。 GSM8K panel shows non-linear\n    jump (format confound annotation)。\n\n    '\n  - 'Fig S2: Coverage calibration plot — observed coverage (y) vs nominal coverage\n    (x) for 4PL+γ variants。With ME: curve below diagonal but close at 95%； without\n    ME: curve further below; linear reg bootstrap: lowest。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'exp-006 confirms the median-tier story：4PL+γ 在 point estimate accuracy\n    上 对 Raw/Emperor/Vanilla-4PL 有 clear improvement (2-3pp MAE reduction)，主要来自 GSM8K@3B\n    的 format inflation correction。但对 linear regression 和 single-signal 2PL+γ 的优势 marginal\n    (0.3-0.5pp, within bootstrap CI overlap)。这并不意味着 4PL+γ 无价值——其 unique contribution\n    是 UQ：(1) credible intervals coverage 0.85 虽未达 nominal 但大幅优于 bootstrap CI 0.72；(2)\n    per-benchmark γ_k 提供了 contamination effect 的 interpretable quantification——γ_GSM8K=1.85\n    vs γ_MMLU=0.12 揭示 contamination susceptibility 的 benchmark heterogeneity；(3) CIs\n    自动 widen for models with poor signal quality (measurement error model)。Per-benchmark\n    vs joint fitting ablation 表明 γ heterogeneity 显著：global γ=0.35 的 MAE (5.8pp) 显著差于\n    per-benchmark (4.3pp)，支持 per-benchmark fitting 为 primary。HumanEval 的 γ CI 包含 0，与\n    QC pass rate 仅 16% 一致——不足以支撑 contamination claim， relegated to appendix。Posterior\n    predictive check 显示 mean residual item correlation 0.08（理想值 0）——local independence\n    violation 的 empirical evidence， 需在 Limitations 讨论。三个 key limitations：(1) 0.5B\n    ability regression 不可 calibrate；(2) GSM8K format confound 使 γ 估计混淆 contamination\n    和 format learning；(3) Coverage gap 10pp (0.85 vs 0.95) 表明 CIs 系统性偏窄。\n\n    '\n- name: scale_bridging_7b\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B controlled SFT injection at 5 dosage levels。 验证 calibration\n    accuracy 是否 scale 到更大模型。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    eval_7B_d000_mmlu: 0.703\n    eval_7B_d000_gsm8k: 0.765\n    eval_7B_d000_arc: 0.882\n    eval_7B_d005_mmlu: 0.705\n    eval_7B_d005_gsm8k: 0.768\n    eval_7B_d005_arc: 0.884\n    eval_7B_d025_mmlu: 0.708\n    eval_7B_d025_gsm8k: 0.775\n    eval_7B_d025_arc: 0.886\n    eval_7B_d050_mmlu: 0.71\n    eval_7B_d050_gsm8k: 0.782\n    eval_7B_d050_arc: 0.887\n    eval_7B_d100_mmlu: 0.715\n    eval_7B_d100_gsm8k: 0.795\n    eval_7B_d100_arc: 0.89\n    inflation_7B_mmlu_pp: 1.2\n    inflation_7B_gsm8k_pp: 3.0\n    inflation_7B_arc_pp: 0.8\n    S1_d005_7B_auc: 0.965\n    S2_d005_7B_auc: 0.555\n    S4_d005_7B_auc: 0.548\n    S2_d100_7B_cohens_d: -1.35\n    calibration_MAE_7B_4pl_gamma: 1.2\n    calibration_MAE_7B_raw: 1.7\n    sft_7B_time_per_run_hours: 10.5\n    sft_7B_gpu_budget_total_hours: 28\n  result_rationale: '7B 模型能力足够高，contamination inflation 极小 (1-3pp) 且与 clean SFT 噪声\n    comparable。MMLU 0.703→0.715 (+1.2pp)：模型已掌握大部分 MMLU 知识， memorization 的 marginal\n    benefit 微弱。GSM8K 0.765→0.795 (+3.0pp)：7B 的 SFT baseline 已经 handle format well（不像\n    3B 的 catastrophic forgetting），所以 contamination effect 是 genuine memorization 而非\n    format recovery。ARC +0.8pp is within noise。S1 at 7B maintains high AUC (0.965)——embedding\n    similarity 与 target model scale 无关。S2 at 7B 微升至 0.555 但仍远低于有效阈值——7B 模型的 perplexity\n    landscape 稍更 structured 但 LoRA 的 parameter footprint 仍然太小 to leave detectable\n    perplexity signature。Min-K++ 方向性反转持续 (d=-1.35)。 Calibration MAE 1.2pp at 7B reflects\n    the ceiling effect：当 contamination inflation 仅 1-3pp 时，所有 calibration methods\n    的 MAE 都很低，improvement 空间有限。7B data point 的主要价值是：(1) 证明 pipeline scales to 7B without\n    degradation；(2) 排除 larger models 可能出现的 new failure modes；(3) 扩充 IRT fitting 的\n    model pool（now 4 scales × 5 dosages = 60 models），改善 γ estimation precision。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 7B Dose-Response Evaluation Scores'\n    data:\n      headers:\n      - dosage\n      - MMLU\n      - GSM8K\n      - ARC\n      rows:\n      - - 0%\n        - 0.703\n        - 0.765\n        - 0.882\n      - - 5%\n        - 0.705\n        - 0.768\n        - 0.884\n      - - 25%\n        - 0.708\n        - 0.775\n        - 0.886\n      - - 50%\n        - 0.71\n        - 0.782\n        - 0.887\n      - - 100%\n        - 0.715\n        - 0.795\n        - 0.89\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Dose-response 扩展图：原有 0.5B/1.5B/3B curves 加入 7B line。7B 是最高的 几乎 flat 线，visually\n    传达 \"大模型 contamination effect 极小\" 的信息。\n\n    '\n  analysis: '7B 结果强化了 contamination effect 的 scale-dependent heterogeneity narrative：\n    (1) 0.5B: contamination HURTS (ability regression)；(2) 1.5B: no effect； (3) 3B:\n    GSM8K format recovery dominates；(4) 7B: genuine but tiny memorization benefit\n    (1-3pp)。只有 7B 展示了 \"clean\" contamination inflation story（无 format confound，无 ability\n    regression）。但 effect size 太小 (1-3pp)，calibration improvement 相应 marginal。For the\n    paper：7B 是 strongest 支持 calibration claim 的 scale（no confounds），但 improvement\n    最小。建议在 Results 中 highlight 7B 作为 \"ideal case\" 然后讨论 smaller scales 的 complications。\n\n    '\n- name: signal_survival_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: 'Detection signal reliability 的 systematic multi-scale evaluation。\n    0.5B v4 已完成，扩展至 1.5B/3B 和 Instruct-proxy RL 分析。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    S1_d005_auc_multiscale_mean: 0.974\n    S2_d005_auc_multiscale_mean: 0.5\n    S3_d005_auc_multiscale_mean: 0.537\n    S4_d005_auc_multiscale_mean: 0.514\n    S2_instruct_05B_auc_d005: 0.488\n    S4_instruct_05B_auc_d005: 0.505\n    S1_instruct_05B_auc_d005: 0.942\n    S2_d100_cohens_d_all_scales:\n    - -1.22\n    - -1.45\n    - -1.63\n    S2_d100_cohens_d_mean: -1.43\n    minkpp_reversal_consistent_across_scales: true\n    S1_d005_cross_model_d_mean: 2.45\n    S1_d025_cross_model_d_mean: 3.8\n    S1_d100_cross_model_d_mean: 3.6\n    scale_dependent_claim_supported: false\n    method_specific_claim_supported: true\n    effective_signals_at_all_scales: 1\n  result_rationale: '信号生存分析的核心结论与 exp-002 一致（数据本质相同，但 exp-008 focus 在 regime 比较和 statistical\n    testing 上）。Instruct-model proxy test 使用 Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct 作为 RL-trained model\n    proxy（RLHF/DPO 过的模型）。S1 在 Instruct 模型上维持 高 AUC (0.942) 因为 embedding similarity\n    不受 target model 训练 regime 影响。 S2 在 Instruct 模型上 AUC 0.488（略低于 SFT 的 0.465，在 noise\n    范围内）—— RLHF 并不帮助 Min-K++ recover contamination signal。S4 在 Instruct 上 0.505 也无改善。S1\n    的 cross-model effect size 在 d005 (2.45) 低于 d100 (3.60) 因为 d005 只有 5% items contaminated，cross-model\n    mean shift 更小。d100 vs d025 的 effect size 相近 (3.60 vs 3.80) 表明 S1 的 discriminability\n    在高 dosage 已 saturate。Min-K++ reversal 的 Cohen''s d 在三个 scale 分别为 -1.22, -1.45,\n    -1.63——reversed 幅度随 scale 增加（更大模型的 LoRA adaptation 对 contaminated items 的 perplexity\n    影响更大，加剧反转）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 2 (Paper): Signal × Scale Effectiveness Summary'\n    data:\n      headers:\n      - signal\n      - mechanism\n      - 0.5B AUC\n      - 1.5B AUC\n      - 3B AUC\n      - Instruct AUC\n      - verdict\n      rows:\n      - - S1 Embedding\n        - External similarity\n        - 0.979\n        - 0.976\n        - 0.971\n        - 0.942\n        - Effective\n      - - S2 Min-K++\n        - Token perplexity\n        - 0.465\n        - 0.502\n        - 0.531\n        - 0.488\n        - Failed + reversed\n      - - S3 ConStat\n        - Performance gap\n        - 0.523\n        - 0.534\n        - 0.56\n        - —\n        - Failed\n      - - S4 Self-Critique\n        - Entropy collapse\n        - 0.481\n        - 0.523\n        - 0.542\n        - 0.505\n        - Failed\n  - name: 'Table: Min-K++ Reversal Evidence'\n    data:\n      headers:\n      - scale\n      - d100 Cohen's d (MMLU)\n      - d100 Cohen's d (GSM8K)\n      - d100 Cohen's d (ARC)\n      - mean\n      - p-value\n      rows:\n      - - 0.5B\n        - -1.22\n        - -2.67\n        - -2.05\n        - -1.98\n        - <1e-100\n      - - 1.5B\n        - -1.05\n        - -1.82\n        - -1.48\n        - -1.45\n        - <1e-80\n      - - 3B\n        - -1.15\n        - -2.1\n        - -1.65\n        - -1.63\n        - <1e-90\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 2 (Paper): AUC heatmap — rows: 4 signals + Instruct proxy, columns: 3 scales\n    × 3 benchmarks。S1 row 全深绿，其余 rows 全灰/浅红。最直观的 main figure。\n\n    '\n  - 'Fig S1: Min-K++ score distributions for d000 vs d100 per scale。Violin plots showing\n    d100 distribution LOWER than d000 (reversed direction)。p-values annotated。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'exp-008 提供 Paper Claim 2 的全部 empirical evidence。核心 narrative 变为 \"method-specific\n    signal failure modes\"：(1) Embedding is the only reliable signal across all scales\n    and regimes (AUC>0.94)；(2) Min-K++ not only fails but actively misleads (directional\n    reversal at all scales, Cohen''s d -1.0 to -2.7)；(3) Self-Critique and ConStat\n    are consistently at chance level。''Scale-dependent'' claim 被放弃因为 1.5B/3B 的 S2/S4\n    AUC 仍<0.60——scale 增加并未恢复信号。 Min-K++ reversal 作为 independent finding 有 significant\n    value：它 challenges the widespread assumption that Min-K++ \"degrades gracefully\"\n    — 实际上它 degrades catastrophically by flipping direction, which is worse than random\n    (negative AUC is dangerous if used as positive evidence)。Instruct proxy test 表明\n    RL post-training 不改变 signal landscape——这是 cautiously positive news for exp-009\n    (observational study)，但也意味着 RL 不帮助 weak signals recover。\n\n    '\n- name: rl_observational_case_study\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: '对现有 RL-trained 模型（Qwen2.5-Instruct, DeepSeek-R1-Distill）应用 calibration\n    pipeline。No controlled ground truth——observational external validity。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    primary_signal_for_observational: S2 + S3 + S4 (no S1 access)\n    effective_signal_auc_observational: 0.53\n    gamma_mmlu_rl_models: 0.1\n    gamma_mmlu_rl_ci:\n    - -0.25\n    - 0.45\n    gamma_gsm8k_rl_models: 0.18\n    gamma_gsm8k_rl_ci:\n    - -0.15\n    - 0.51\n    gamma_arc_rl_models: 0.05\n    gamma_arc_rl_ci:\n    - -0.3\n    - 0.4\n    avg_ci_width_rl_pp: 15.5\n    gamma_clean_benchmark_mean: 0.02\n    gamma_clean_benchmark_ci:\n    - -0.2\n    - 0.24\n    specificity_test_pass: true\n    regret_uncalibrated_pp: 2.8\n    regret_calibrated_pp: 2.3\n    regret_delta_pp: 0.5\n    n_observational_models: 10\n  result_rationale: 'Observational study 的核心限制：无法使用 S1 (Embedding) 因为 Qwen2.5-Instruct\n    和 DeepSeek-R1 的 exact training data 不可得。剩余 S2/S3/S4 在 controlled experiments 中\n    AUC~0.50，因此 exposure estimates 本质上是 noise。IRT model 在 noisy exposure input 下的\n    γ 后验接近先验（data 提供的 information 极少）， CI 极宽 (15.5pp)。γ 的 point estimates 微正（0.05-0.18）可能反映\n    true contamination 也可能是 noise——CI 全部包含 0。Near-zero γ check 的 specificity test\n    通过：在已知 clean benchmark (LiveBench subset) 上 γ≈0.02，CI 包含 0。 这证明 pipeline 不会 hallucinate\n    contamination where none exists。但 sensitivity 太低：即使存在 moderate contamination，pipeline\n    也无法检出（因为 signals 是 noise）。Expected regret 改善微弱 (0.5pp)：calibrated top-5 selection\n    与 uncalibrated 几乎相同因为校准本身是 noisy。价值在于 CIs 的 honest width 传达了 epistemic uncertainty——用户知道这些模型的\n    calibration 不可靠。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: RL Observational Model Calibrated Scores'\n    data:\n      headers:\n      - model\n      - benchmark\n      - raw_score\n      - calibrated_mean\n      - 95% CI\n      - CI_width\n      rows:\n      - - Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct\n        - MMLU\n        - 0.445\n        - 0.438\n        - '[0.35, 0.53]'\n        - 18.0\n      - - Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct\n        - MMLU\n        - 0.605\n        - 0.598\n        - '[0.52, 0.68]'\n        - 16.0\n      - - Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\n        - MMLU\n        - 0.658\n        - 0.652\n        - '[0.58, 0.72]'\n        - 14.0\n      - - Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n        - MMLU\n        - 0.742\n        - 0.735\n        - '[0.67, 0.80]'\n        - 13.0\n      - - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B\n        - MMLU\n        - 0.55\n        - 0.543\n        - '[0.46, 0.63]'\n        - 17.0\n      - - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B\n        - MMLU\n        - 0.71\n        - 0.704\n        - '[0.63, 0.78]'\n        - 15.0\n  - name: 'Table: Expected Regret (Top-5 Selection)'\n    data:\n      headers:\n      - strategy\n      - avg_score_of_top5\n      - regret_vs_oracle_pp\n      rows:\n      - - Uncalibrated\n        - 0.685\n        - 2.8\n      - - Calibrated\n        - 0.69\n        - 2.3\n      - - Remove-rescore\n        - 0.682\n        - 3.1\n  figures_description:\n  - 'RL model scores with wide CIs: forest plot of calibrated scores with error bars。CIs\n    almost all overlap → \"we cannot distinguish contaminated from clean in observational\n    setting\" 的 visual message。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'exp-009 delivers exactly the median-tier outcome：directional external\n    validity only, not quantitative validation。Without S1 access, the pipeline loses\n    its only effective signal。This is the most important structural limitation of\n    ContamCal for practical deployment：it requires training data access (or at minimum,\n    a high-quality contamination reference corpus) for the embedding signal。Paper\n    应 frame this as：\"In the controlled setting (training data known), ContamCal provides\n    meaningful calibration with moderate UQ。In the observational setting (training\n    data unknown), it provides honest uncertainty bounds that correctly convey the\n    epistemic limitation。\" The near-zero γ specificity check is a genuinely useful\n    result：it demonstrates the framework doesn''t over-calibrate clean data。Expected\n    regret improvement of 0.5pp is not statistically significant but directionally\n    correct。建议 paper 将 exp-009 作为 \"Application Case Study\" 而非 core validation，强调 CIs\n    的 informational value over point estimates。\n\n    '\n- name: observational_72b\n  plan_id: exp-012\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-72B observational analysis。Inference only (no SFT)。 Extends\n    ecological validity to frontier model scale。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    eval_72B_mmlu: 0.858\n    eval_72B_gsm8k: 0.912\n    eval_72B_arc: 0.955\n    S2_72B_mmlu_auc: N/A (no contamination labels)\n    S2_72B_minkpp_mean_score: 1.85\n    S4_72B_selfcritique_entropy_mean: -0.82\n    calibrated_72B_mmlu: 0.852\n    calibrated_72B_mmlu_ci:\n    - 0.78\n    - 0.92\n    calibrated_72B_gsm8k: 0.905\n    calibrated_72B_gsm8k_ci:\n    - 0.83\n    - 0.97\n    calibrated_72B_arc: 0.951\n    calibrated_72B_arc_ci:\n    - 0.89\n    - 1.0\n    avg_ci_width_pp: 12.8\n    inference_time_hours: 8\n  result_rationale: '72B 是 frontier-scale 生态效度测试。与 exp-009 相同的 fundamental limitation：\n    无 training data access → 无 S1 → exposure estimates 基于 S2/S4 (noise)。 Calibrated\n    scores 仅微降 (0.5-0.7pp)，CIs 宽 (~13pp)——framework 诚实地传达 \"we don''t know whether\n    this model is contaminated or not\"。72B 的 near-ceiling scores (MMLU 0.858, ARC\n    0.955) 使得 calibration 空间本身有限：即使存在 contamination，最大 inflation 也受 ceiling 约束。主要价值：(1)\n    证明 pipeline 可以 handle frontier-scale 模型的 inference cost；(2) 在 paper 中 report 72B\n    results 增加 reviewer confidence（\"they tested on big models too\"）；(3) 宽 CIs 示范了\n    uncertainty-aware evaluation 的价值。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 72B Observational Calibration'\n    data:\n      headers:\n      - benchmark\n      - raw\n      - calibrated\n      - 95% CI\n      - CI width (pp)\n      rows:\n      - - MMLU\n        - 0.858\n        - 0.852\n        - '[0.78, 0.92]'\n        - 14.0\n      - - GSM8K\n        - 0.912\n        - 0.905\n        - '[0.83, 0.97]'\n        - 14.0\n      - - ARC\n        - 0.955\n        - 0.951\n        - '[0.89, 1.00]'\n        - 11.0\n  figures_description:\n  - '扩展 Fig 5 (scatter plot)：增加 72B 点 with 巨大 error bars，突出与 controlled models (tight\n    CIs) 的对比。\n\n    '\n  analysis: '72B observational 的加入提升了 paper 的 model coverage story (0.5B→72B) 但不提供\n    quantitative validation。建议 paper 在 one paragraph 中 report 72B results，作为 \"scaling\n    demonstration\" 而非 evidence for calibration accuracy。关键 takeaway：ContamCal at 72B\n    = wide CIs indicating genuine epistemic uncertainty about contamination status，which\n    is the correct scientific answer when we lack sufficient signal quality。\n\n    '\n- name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n  plan_id: exp-013\n  description: 'Degraded 2-signal mode (ConStat + Self-Critique only, no logits/embeddings)\n    模拟 closed-weight API-only models 的场景。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    rrf_2signal_auc_05B: 0.51\n    rrf_2signal_auc_15B: 0.53\n    rrf_2signal_auc_3B: 0.548\n    rrf_2signal_auc_mean: 0.529\n    MAE_2signal_4pl_gamma: 6.7\n    MAE_2signal_4pl_gamma_ci:\n    - 5.0\n    - 8.4\n    CI_coverage_95_2signal: 0.7\n    CI_width_avg_2signal_pp: 12.5\n    MAE_gap_vs_4signal_pp: 2.4\n    coverage_gap_vs_4signal: 0.15\n    kendall_tau_2signal: 0.8\n  result_rationale: '2-signal mode (S3+S4) 的 RRF AUC 0.53 意味着 exposure scores 几乎是\n    random noise。IRT model 在 random exposure input 下：γ posterior 被 prior dominated\n    (data 无 information)，calibrated scores ≈ vanilla IRT 预测（no contamination correction）。MAE\n    6.7pp 仅略优于 vanilla 4PL 的 6.0pp——improvement 可能来自 S3/S4 的残余微弱 signal (AUC 0.53\n    不完全是 0.50) 但 statistically insignificant。 Coverage 0.70 低于 4-signal 的 0.85 因为\n    measurement error 更大但 ME model 无法正确估计 noise level (σ_e calibration 来自 controlled\n    experiments where S1 was available)。CI width 12.5pp 虽然 wider 但不够 wide to compensate\n    for near-random exposure。Kendall tau 0.80 接近 Raw 0.82——calibration 未破坏 ranking\n    但也未改善。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal Calibration Comparison'\n    data:\n      headers:\n      - metric\n      - 4-signal (S1-dom)\n      - 2-signal (S3+S4)\n      - gap\n      rows:\n      - - MAE (pp)\n        - 4.3\n        - 6.7\n        - 2.4\n      - - 95% Coverage\n        - 0.85\n        - 0.7\n        - -0.15\n      - - CI Width (pp)\n        - 8.5\n        - 12.5\n        - 4.0\n      - - Kendall τ\n        - 0.85\n        - 0.8\n        - -0.05\n      - - Exposure AUC\n        - 0.947\n        - 0.529\n        - -0.418\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Paired comparison: 4-signal vs 2-signal calibrated scores for same models。 4-signal\n    版本 tight CIs close to diagonal; 2-signal 版本 wide CIs, points scattered。Visual\n    demonstration of information loss。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'exp-013 quantifies the cost of closed-weight constraint: 2.4pp MAE degradation\n    and 15pp coverage drop。Practical implication：ContamCal is NOT viable for closed-weight\n    models (GPT-4, Claude, Gemini) in current form。This is a fundamental limitation,\n    not a fixable gap。Paper 应 frame this as honest scoping：\"ContamCal requires model\n    logit/embedding access for effective calibration。For closed-weight models, the\n    framework provides only uncertainty bounds (wide CIs) without meaningful point\n    estimate correction。\" Potential future work: stronger closed-weight signals (e.g.,\n    output distribution analysis, benchmark-specific probing) could close this gap。\n\n    '\n- name: multi_family_validation\n  plan_id: exp-014\n  description: 'Controlled SFT injection on non-Qwen model (Llama-3.2-1B) at 3 dosage\n    levels。 Rebuttal-ready validation of cross-family generalization。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    eval_llama1B_d000_mmlu: 0.432\n    eval_llama1B_d000_gsm8k: 0.285\n    eval_llama1B_d000_arc: 0.52\n    eval_llama1B_d025_mmlu: 0.385\n    eval_llama1B_d025_gsm8k: 0.28\n    eval_llama1B_d025_arc: 0.445\n    eval_llama1B_d100_mmlu: 0.345\n    eval_llama1B_d100_gsm8k: 0.275\n    eval_llama1B_d100_arc: 0.395\n    contamination_effect_pattern: regression (same as Qwen 0.5B)\n    mmlu_d100_delta_pp: -8.7\n    arc_d100_delta_pp: -12.5\n    gsm8k_d100_delta_pp: -1.0\n    S1_d005_llama_auc: 0.968\n    S2_d005_llama_auc: 0.478\n    S4_d005_llama_auc: 0.495\n    S2_d100_llama_cohens_d: -1.55\n    calibration_MAE_llama_4pl: 5.8\n    calibration_MAE_llama_4pl_ci:\n    - 3.8\n    - 7.8\n    signal_pattern_matches_qwen: true\n    regression_pattern_matches_qwen_05B: true\n    sft_llama_time_per_run_hours: 2.5\n    sft_llama_gpu_budget_hours: 8\n  result_rationale: 'Llama-3.2-1B (1.24B params) 与 Qwen2.5-0.5B 规模相近，预期展现相同的 contamination\n    regression pattern：小模型无法从 memorization 获益，contaminated SFT 反而 disrupts general\n    ability。MMLU -8.7pp 和 ARC -12.5pp 的 regression 幅度与 Qwen 0.5B (-11.8pp / -14.4pp\n    at d025) 量级一致，但具体数值不同（different architecture, tokenizer, training dynamics）。GSM8K\n    变化微小 (-1.0pp) 因为 Llama-1B 的 GSM8K baseline (28.5%) 没有 catastrophic forgetting\n    问题。Signal effectiveness 完美复现 Qwen pattern：S1 高 (0.968)，S2/S4 chance level， Min-K++\n    方向反转。S1 的 cross-family consistency (Qwen 0.979, Llama 0.968) confirms embedding\n    signal 是 truly model-agnostic。Calibration MAE 5.8pp 略高于 Qwen average (4.3pp) 因为只有\n    3 dosage levels（fewer data points for γ estimation） 且 only 1 scale（no multi-scale\n    information to help identify γ）。Bootstrap CI [3.8, 7.8] 与 Qwen CI [3.1, 5.5] 部分重叠，无法\n    reject 两者的 calibration accuracy 相同。关键 rebuttal message：\"method and signal patterns\n    generalize across model families; single-family limitation acknowledged but does\n    not invalidate core findings。\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cross-Family Signal Comparison'\n    data:\n      headers:\n      - signal\n      - Qwen 0.5B AUC\n      - Llama 1B AUC\n      - Consistent?\n      rows:\n      - - S1 Embedding\n        - 0.979\n        - 0.968\n        - Yes (Δ=0.011)\n      - - S2 Min-K++\n        - 0.465\n        - 0.478\n        - Yes (both chance)\n      - - S4 Self-Critique\n        - 0.481\n        - 0.495\n        - Yes (both chance)\n      - - S2 reversal (d)\n        - -1.98\n        - -1.55\n        - Yes (both negative)\n  - name: 'Table: Cross-Family Calibration Comparison'\n    data:\n      headers:\n      - metric\n      - Qwen_all_scales\n      - Llama_1B\n      - consistent\n      rows:\n      - - MAE (pp)\n        - 4.3 [3.1, 5.5]\n        - 5.8 [3.8, 7.8]\n        - CIs overlap\n      - - 95% Coverage\n        - 0.85\n        - 0.8\n        - Within range\n      - - γ_MMLU\n        - 0.12 [-0.03, 0.27]\n        - 0.10 [-0.10, 0.30]\n        - CIs overlap\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cross-family signal pattern comparison: paired bar chart of AUC values for Qwen\n    vs Llama per signal。Pattern identical (S1 high, S2/S4 low) regardless of family。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'exp-014 confirms cross-family generalization at the pattern level: signal\n    effectiveness, contamination regression at small scale, and Min-K++ reversal all\n    replicate。Quantitative calibration accuracy is comparable (overlapping CIs) but\n    less precise due to fewer conditions。For rebuttal strategy：if reviewer asks \"why\n    only Qwen?\", response is \"(1) Qwen provides controlled multi-scale setup with\n    consistent tokenizer/architecture; (2) Llama replication confirms patterns generalize;\n    (3) full multi-family, multi-scale validation is scientifically valuable but exceeds\n    single-paper scope — provided as rebuttal evidence。\" The Llama results also independently\n    validate the small-model regression finding: contamination SFT hurts ~1B models\n    across architectures, not just Qwen。This is a second novel empirical finding (alongside\n    Min-K++ reversal) that the detection community should know about。'\n","numLines":1169,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1169}}}
