{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01YXTiWFvg6aZYjnaDi76NTa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Review submitted successfully.\n\n**Consolidated verdict: 3/6 Weak Reject (Unanimous)**\n\nKey findings from the two-reviewer roundtable:\n\n- **Marginal calibration advantage**: 4.3pp MAE vs 4.8pp linear regression — CIs overlap, statistically indistinguishable\n- **UQ claim undermined**: 85% coverage at 95% nominal = 10pp gap; the paper's distinctive contribution is itself miscalibrated\n- **Single-signal reality**: Multi-signal RRF degrades vs S1-only (0.947 vs 0.975 AUC); framework is aspirational, not functional\n- **GSM8K confound**: The only significant γ (1.85) captures format recovery, not pure contamination\n- **Limited novelty**: Standard explanatory IRT applied to new domain; each component is off-the-shelf\n\n**Strongest elements**: Min-K++ directional reversal finding, signal characterization across scales, Fisher Information analysis, and transparent limitation reporting. The path to acceptance centers on reframing around the signal characterization as the primary contribution, diagnosing the coverage gap formally, and scaling N_models for reliable parameter recovery."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5785,"cache_read_input_tokens":72111,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5785},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d1bd2efb-8d16-4e43-8307-de39852ed51a","uuid":"325ae3c6-6ea2-4b6b-8f45-cb6c36dbfaf7"}
